window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b038-c7860dff5eabb2b0.json"]={sha256:"c7860dff5eabb2b0264847a51b1a46912a846a82000330c4e43256461bf9be2d",value:{"id":"b038","title":"橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工","titleEn":"Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁出發，計算施工期不平衡荷載與墩頂臨時固結，再處理懸臂鋼腱、節塊接縫、懸臂工作車循環、溫度與潛變造成的線形偏差與跨中閉合，最後以伸長量、測量回饋與長期撓度監測驗證，並以 Bendorf 橋、Stolma 橋與 Koror–Babeldaob 橋的成敗對照。","summaryEn":"Starting from cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder, compute construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary pier fixity, then handle cantilever tendons, segment joints, the form-traveler cycle, thermal and creep effects on geometry and the midspan closure, and finally verify with elongations, survey feedback and long-term deflection monitoring, contrasting Bendorf, Stolma and the Koror–Babeldaob bridge.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-bridge-construction","subcategoryTitle":"橋梁施工工法與大型架設","subcategoryTitleEn":"Bridge construction methods and heavy erection","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-bridge-construction","learningTags":["structures","st-bridge-construction","segmental"],"architectureFamily":"segmental","architectureNodes":[["橋墩與臨時固結","Pier and temporary fixity"],["柱頭段","Pier table"],["懸臂節塊與工作車","Cantilever segments and traveler"],["懸臂與連續鋼腱","Cantilever and continuity tendons"],["跨中閉合段","Midspan closure"],["線形測量與回饋","Geometry survey and feedback"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[5,2],[5,4]],"diagram":{"type":"segmental","labels":["橋墩與臨時固結","柱頭段","懸臂節塊與工作車","懸臂與連續鋼腱","跨中閉合段"],"labelsEn":["Pier and temporary fixity","Pier table","Cantilever segments and traveler","Cantilever and continuity tendons","Midspan closure"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：一座 150 m 主跨的場鑄平衡懸臂箱梁，計算第 10 號節塊端點的澆置預拱。預測各項撓度（向下為負）：本節塊與後續節塊自重 −45 mm、懸臂鋼腱上拱 +20 mm、長期潛變與乾縮 −30 mm、閉合與連續鋼腱 +6 mm、鋪面與護欄 −12 mm，合計 −45 + 20 − 30 + 6 − 12 = −61 mm，所以節塊須澆在完工高程之上 61 mm。工作車在濕混凝土下另下撓 8 mm，因此模板應設在完工高程之上 61 + 8 = 69 mm。若實際潛變係數比假設大 25%，潛變項變為 −30×1.25 = −37.5 mm，總預拱變為 68.5 mm，模板須設在 76.5 mm；若仍以 69 mm 澆置，該點長期約低 7.5 mm。這說明潛變參數的不確定性為何要在設計時做敏感度分析並在施工中回饋修正。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際橋梁的設計。","textEn":"Design exercise: for a 150 m cast-in-place balanced-cantilever box girder, compute the casting camber at the tip of segment 10. Predicted deflections (downward negative): self-weight of this and later segments −45 mm, cantilever prestress uplift +20 mm, long-term creep and shrinkage −30 mm, closure and continuity tendons +6 mm, surfacing and barriers −12 mm, totalling −45 + 20 − 30 + 6 − 12 = −61 mm, so the segment must be cast 61 mm above the final profile. The traveler deflects another 8 mm under wet concrete, so the forms are set 61 + 8 = 69 mm above the final profile. If the real creep coefficient is 25% higher than assumed, the creep term becomes −30×1.25 = −37.5 mm, the total camber 68.5 mm and the form setting 76.5 mm; casting at 69 mm would leave that point about 7.5 mm low in the long term. This shows why creep uncertainty needs a design sensitivity study and feedback correction during construction. Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of any real bridge.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b038-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁」與「施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder\" and \"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b038-v13-01","title":"懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「墩頂變高度箱梁」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Haunched box girder at the pier” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"平衡懸臂工法讓每一座橋墩成為一個 T 形構架：節塊由柱頭段向兩側對稱延伸，施工期間整個懸臂只靠墩頂承受負彎矩，彎矩隨懸臂長度的平方增長。因此箱梁在墩頂最深、跨中最淺，底板在墩頂加厚以承受壓力，頂板則容納大量懸臂鋼腱。跨中閉合並張拉連續鋼腱後，結構才轉為連續梁，跨中正彎矩出現；施工期與營運期的內力分布截然不同，設計必須逐階段追蹤。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「墩頂變高度箱梁」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Balanced-cantilever construction turns each pier into a T-frame: segments grow symmetrically from the pier table, and during construction the whole cantilever is carried by hogging moment at the pier, which grows with the square of the cantilever length. The box girder is therefore deepest at the pier and shallowest at midspan; the bottom slab thickens near the pier to carry compression while the top slab houses many cantilever tendons. Only after midspan closure and continuity tendons does the structure become a continuous girder with sagging moment at midspan, so construction-stage and service-stage force distributions differ completely and the design must track every stage. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Haunched box girder at the pier” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：懸臂根部彎矩 M = w·L²/2。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Root moment of the cantilever M = w·L²/2.","failure":"常見誤解：「平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「墩頂變高度箱梁」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Haunched box girder at the pier”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-01-k1","title":"懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁","titleEn":"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder","text":"平衡懸臂工法讓每一座橋墩成為一個 T 形構架：節塊由柱頭段向兩側對稱延伸，施工期間整個懸臂只靠墩頂承受負彎矩，彎矩隨懸臂長度的平方增長。因此箱梁在墩頂最深、跨中最淺，底板在墩頂加厚以承受壓力，頂板則容納大量懸臂鋼腱。","textEn":"Balanced-cantilever construction turns each pier into a T-frame: segments grow symmetrically from the pier table, and during construction the whole cantilever is carried by hogging moment at the pier, which grows with the square of the cantilever length. The box girder is therefore deepest at the pier and shallowest at midspan; the bottom slab thickens near the pier to carry compression while the top slab houses many cantilever tendons.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder\" is correct?","options":["平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。","平衡懸臂工法讓每一座橋墩成為一個 T 形構架：節塊由柱頭段向兩側對稱延伸，施工期間整個懸臂只靠墩頂承受負彎矩，彎矩隨懸臂長度的平方增長。","只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。"],"optionsEn":["A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough.","Balanced-cantilever construction turns each pier into a T-frame: segments grow symmetrically from the pier table, and during construction the whole cantilever is carried by hogging moment at the pier, which grows with the square of the cantilever length.","If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier."],"answer":1,"explanation":"平衡懸臂工法讓每一座橋墩成為一個 T 形構架：節塊由柱頭段向兩側對稱延伸，施工期間整個懸臂只靠墩頂承受負彎矩，彎矩隨懸臂長度的平方增長。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Balanced-cantilever construction turns each pier into a T-frame: segments grow symmetrically from the pier table, and during construction the whole cantilever is carried by hogging moment at the pier, which grows with the square of the cantilever length. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b038-v13-02","title":"懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁：定量估算","titleEn":"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「墩頂變高度箱梁」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Haunched box girder at the pier” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：懸臂根部彎矩 M = w·L²/2。取主跨 150 m、懸臂 L = 75 m、平均自重 w = 300 kN/m，M = 300×75²/2 ≈ 843,750 kN·m。若墩頂梁深取跨度 1/17 ≈ 8.8 m、跨中取 1/45 ≈ 3.3 m，所需懸臂預力約 P ≈ M/(0.75h) = 843,750/(0.75×8.8) ≈ 127,500 kN。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Root moment of the cantilever M = w·L²/2. For a 150 m main span, cantilever L = 75 m and average self-weight w = 300 kN/m, M = 300×75²/2 ≈ 843,750 kN·m. With a pier depth of span/17 ≈ 8.8 m and a midspan depth of span/45 ≈ 3.3 m, the required cantilever prestress is roughly P ≈ M/(0.75h) = 843,750/(0.75×8.8) ≈ 127,500 kN. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以施工階段分析軟體逐一加入節塊、工作車、鋼腱與閉合，輸出每一階段墩頂與各接縫的上下緣應力，與手算 M = wL²/2 及容許應力（施工期頂緣不得出現超過規範的拉應力）比較；同時核對變高度曲線（拋物線或多項式）在每個節塊端點的梁深與圖說一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run a construction-stage analysis that adds each segment, traveler, tendon and the closure in sequence, output top- and bottom-fibre stresses at the pier and at every joint for every stage, and compare them with the hand estimate M = wL²/2 and the allowable stresses, with no top-fibre tension beyond the code limit during construction; also check that the haunch curve, parabolic or polynomial, gives the drawing depth at every segment end.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"懸臂根部彎矩 M = w·L²/2。取主跨 150 m、懸臂 L = 75 m、平均自重 w = 300 kN/m，M = 300×75²/2 ≈ 843,750 kN·m。若墩頂梁深取跨度 1/17 ≈ 8.8 m、跨中取 1/45 ≈ 3.3 m，所需懸臂預力約 P ≈ M/(0.75h) = 843,750/(0.75×8.8) ≈ 127,500 kN。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Root moment of the cantilever M = w·L²/2. For a 150 m main span, cantilever L = 75 m and average self-weight w = 300 kN/m, M = 300×75²/2 ≈ 843,750 kN·m. With a pier depth of span/17 ≈ 8.8 m and a midspan depth of span/45 ≈ 3.3 m, the required cantilever prestress is roughly P ≈ M/(0.75h) = 843,750/(0.75×8.8) ≈ 127,500 kN. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder\", which statement holds?","options":["預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。","只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。","懸臂根部彎矩 M = w·L²/2。"],"optionsEn":["The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion.","Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.","Root moment of the cantilever M = w·L²/2."],"answer":2,"explanation":"懸臂根部彎矩 M = w·L²/2。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Root moment of the cantilever M = w·L²/2. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b038-v13-03","title":"懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「墩頂變高度箱梁」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Haunched box girder at the pier” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以施工階段分析軟體逐一加入節塊、工作車、鋼腱與閉合，輸出每一階段墩頂與各接縫的上下緣應力，與手算 M = wL²/2 及容許應力（施工期頂緣不得出現超過規範的拉應力）比較；同時核對變高度曲線（拋物線或多項式）在每個節塊端點的梁深與圖說一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run a construction-stage analysis that adds each segment, traveler, tendon and the closure in sequence, output top- and bottom-fibre stresses at the pier and at every joint for every stage, and compare them with the hand estimate M = wL²/2 and the allowable stresses, with no top-fibre tension beyond the code limit during construction; also check that the haunch curve, parabolic or polynomial, gives the drawing depth at every segment end. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計說明書必須列出施工順序假設（節塊長度、工作車重量、張拉時程與閉合順序），並註明承包商若變更順序須重新提送施工階段分析，經設計單位審查同意後方可執行。","observationEn":"Site practice: The design report must state the assumed construction sequence (segment lengths, traveler weight, stressing times and closure order) and require the contractor to resubmit a construction-stage analysis, reviewed and accepted by the designer, before any change to that sequence.","failure":"注意干擾：若只以完工後的連續梁模型設計，忽略懸臂階段的負彎矩峰值與施工期鋼腱尚未全部張拉的狀態，墩頂附近頂板可能在懸臂末段出現橫向裂縫，底板則因壓應力過高而壓碎或剝落。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Designing only with the finished continuous-girder model, ignoring the hogging peak of the cantilever stage and the state before all tendons are stressed, can crack the top slab transversely near the pier during the last cantilever segments and overstress the bottom slab in compression until it spalls. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以施工階段分析軟體逐一加入節塊、工作車、鋼腱與閉合，輸出每一階段墩頂與各接縫的上下緣應力，與手算 M = wL²/2 及容許應力（施工期頂緣不得出現超過規範的拉應力）比較；同時核對變高度曲線（拋物線或多項式）在每個節塊端點的梁深與圖說一致。","textEn":"Run a construction-stage analysis that adds each segment, traveler, tendon and the closure in sequence, output top- and bottom-fibre stresses at the pier and at every joint for every stage, and compare them with the hand estimate M = wL²/2 and the allowable stresses, with no top-fibre tension beyond the code limit during construction; also check that the haunch curve, parabolic or polynomial, gives the drawing depth at every segment end.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計說明書必須列出施工順序假設（節塊長度、工作車重量、張拉時程與閉合順序），並註明承包商若變更順序須重新提送施工階段分析，經設計單位審查同意後方可執行。","textEn":"The design report must state the assumed construction sequence (segment lengths, traveler weight, stressing times and closure order) and require the contractor to resubmit a construction-stage analysis, reviewed and accepted by the designer, before any change to that sequence.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder\"?","options":["以施工階段分析軟體逐一加入節塊、工作車、鋼腱與閉合，輸出每一階段墩頂與各接縫的上下緣應力，與手算 M = wL²/2 及容許應力（施工期頂緣不得出現超過規範的拉應力）比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。"],"optionsEn":["Run a construction-stage analysis that adds each segment, traveler, tendon and the closure in sequence, output top- and bottom-fibre stresses at the pier and at every joint for every stage, and compare them with the hand estimate M = wL²/2 and the allowable stresses, with no top-fibre tension beyond the code limit during construction.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以施工階段分析軟體逐一加入節塊、工作車、鋼腱與閉合，輸出每一階段墩頂與各接縫的上下緣應力，與手算 M = wL²/2 及容許應力（施工期頂緣不得出現超過規範的拉應力）比較；同時核對變高度曲線（拋物線或多項式）在每個節塊端點的梁深與圖說一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run a construction-stage analysis that adds each segment, traveler, tendon and the closure in sequence, output top- and bottom-fibre stresses at the pier and at every joint for every stage, and compare them with the hand estimate M = wL²/2 and the allowable stresses, with no top-fibre tension beyond the code limit during construction; also check that the haunch curve, parabolic or polynomial, gives the drawing depth at every segment end. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b038-v13-04","title":"懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「墩頂變高度箱梁」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Haunched box girder at the pier” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若只以完工後的連續梁模型設計，忽略懸臂階段的負彎矩峰值與施工期鋼腱尚未全部張拉的狀態，墩頂附近頂板可能在懸臂末段出現橫向裂縫，底板則因壓應力過高而壓碎或剝落。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Designing only with the finished continuous-girder model, ignoring the hogging peak of the cantilever stage and the state before all tendons are stressed, can crack the top slab transversely near the pier during the last cantilever segments and overstress the bottom slab in compression until it spalls. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：跨中閉合並張拉連續鋼腱後，結構才轉為連續梁，跨中正彎矩出現；施工期與營運期的內力分布截然不同，設計必須逐階段追蹤。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Only after midspan closure and continuity tendons does the structure become a continuous girder with sagging moment at midspan, so construction-stage and service-stage force distributions differ completely and the design must track every stage.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只以完工後的連續梁模型設計，忽略懸臂階段的負彎矩峰值與施工期鋼腱尚未全部張拉的狀態，墩頂附近頂板可能在懸臂末段出現橫向裂縫，底板則因壓應力過高而壓碎或剝落。","textEn":"Designing only with the finished continuous-girder model, ignoring the hogging peak of the cantilever stage and the state before all tendons are stressed, can crack the top slab transversely near the pier during the last cantilever segments and overstress the bottom slab in compression until it spalls.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「懸臂負彎矩與變高度箱梁」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cantilever hogging moment and the haunched box girder\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若只以完工後的連續梁模型設計，忽略懸臂階段的負彎矩峰值與施工期鋼腱尚未全部張拉的狀態，墩頂附近頂板可能在懸臂末段出現橫向裂縫，底板則因壓應力過高而壓碎或剝落。","只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Designing only with the finished continuous-girder model, ignoring the hogging peak of the cantilever stage and the state before all tendons are stressed, can crack the top slab transversely near the pier during the last cantilever segments and overstress the bottom slab in compression until it spalls.","If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若只以完工後的連續梁模型設計，忽略懸臂階段的負彎矩峰值與施工期鋼腱尚未全部張拉的狀態，墩頂附近頂板可能在懸臂末段出現橫向裂縫，底板則因壓應力過高而壓碎或剝落。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Designing only with the finished continuous-girder model, ignoring the hogging peak of the cantilever stage and the state before all tendons are stressed, can crack the top slab transversely near the pier during the last cantilever segments and overstress the bottom slab in compression until it spalls. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b038-v13-05","title":"施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「墩頂臨時固結」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Temporary pier fixity” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"兩側懸臂永遠不會完全平衡：一側節塊先澆、工作車前移時間不同、施工材料堆放不對稱、甚至一個預鑄節塊意外掉落，都會在墩頂產生不平衡彎矩。若永久支承是可滑動或可轉動的，懸臂期間必須用臨時固結把箱梁與墩身鎖成剛接，常見作法是墩頂臨時混凝土墊塊加預力鋼棒錨拉，或在墩旁設臨時支撐塔。分段橋設計規範要求檢核差異自重、施工活載、施工機具與節塊意外釋放等施工荷載組合。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「墩頂臨時固結」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The two cantilevers are never perfectly balanced: one segment is cast first, travelers advance at different times, materials are stacked unevenly, and a precast segment could even be dropped, each creating an unbalanced moment at the pier. If the permanent bearings slide or rotate, the girder must be locked to the pier during cantilevering, usually with temporary concrete blocks plus post-tensioned tie-down bars, or with temporary towers beside the pier. Segmental design provisions require construction load combinations covering differential dead load, construction live load, equipment and accidental release of a segment. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Temporary pier fixity” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：一側先澆 4 m 節塊 W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN，力臂 72 m，彎矩 86,400 kN·m；加上一側自重多 2% 的差異荷載 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m，合計 M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: One 4 m segment cast ahead weighs W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN at a 72 m arm, giving 86,400 kN·m; a 2% differential dead load on one side adds 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m, for M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「墩頂臨時固結」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Temporary pier fixity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-05-k1","title":"施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結","titleEn":"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity","text":"兩側懸臂永遠不會完全平衡：一側節塊先澆、工作車前移時間不同、施工材料堆放不對稱、甚至一個預鑄節塊意外掉落，都會在墩頂產生不平衡彎矩。若永久支承是可滑動或可轉動的，懸臂期間必須用臨時固結把箱梁與墩身鎖成剛接，常見作法是墩頂臨時混凝土墊塊加預力鋼棒錨拉，或在墩旁設臨時支撐塔。","textEn":"The two cantilevers are never perfectly balanced: one segment is cast first, travelers advance at different times, materials are stacked unevenly, and a precast segment could even be dropped, each creating an unbalanced moment at the pier. If the permanent bearings slide or rotate, the girder must be locked to the pier during cantilevering, usually with temporary concrete blocks plus post-tensioned tie-down bars, or with temporary towers beside the pier.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity\" is correct?","options":["只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。","懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。","兩側懸臂永遠不會完全平衡：一側節塊先澆、工作車前移時間不同、施工材料堆放不對稱、甚至一個預鑄節塊意外掉落，都會在墩頂產生不平衡彎矩。"],"optionsEn":["If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier.","Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.","The two cantilevers are never perfectly balanced: one segment is cast first, travelers advance at different times, materials are stacked unevenly, and a precast segment could even be dropped, each creating an unbalanced moment at the pier."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩側懸臂永遠不會完全平衡：一側節塊先澆、工作車前移時間不同、施工材料堆放不對稱、甚至一個預鑄節塊意外掉落，都會在墩頂產生不平衡彎矩。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The two cantilevers are never perfectly balanced: one segment is cast first, travelers advance at different times, materials are stacked unevenly, and a precast segment could even be dropped, each creating an unbalanced moment at the pier. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b038-v13-06","title":"施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結：定量估算","titleEn":"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「墩頂臨時固結」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Temporary pier fixity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：一側先澆 4 m 節塊 W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN，力臂 72 m，彎矩 86,400 kN·m；加上一側自重多 2% 的差異荷載 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m，合計 M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m。墩頂兩排臨時墊塊相距 4.0 m、總垂直力 N = 300×150 = 45,000 kN，單排反力 R = 22,500 ± 103,275/4.0 = 22,500 ± 25,819 kN，最小值約 −3,319 kN，表示需錨拉鋼棒。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: One 4 m segment cast ahead weighs W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN at a 72 m arm, giving 86,400 kN·m; a 2% differential dead load on one side adds 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m, for M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m. With two rows of temporary blocks 4.0 m apart and N = 300×150 = 45,000 kN, each row carries R = 22,500 ± 103,275/4.0 = 22,500 ± 25,819 kN; the minimum, about −3,319 kN, means tie-down bars are required. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：臨時固結設計須列出每一種施工荷載組合下的墊塊壓力與錨拉鋼棒拉力，鋼棒以千斤頂壓力錶與伸長量雙重確認張拉值；懸臂施工期間定期量測兩側懸臂端高程差與墩頂傾斜，若傾斜趨勢與不平衡荷載預測不符，立即停止下一節塊作業。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: The temporary-fixity design must list block pressures and tie-down bar forces for every construction load combination; bars are verified by both jack gauge pressure and elongation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"一側先澆 4 m 節塊 W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN，力臂 72 m，彎矩 86,400 kN·m；加上一側自重多 2% 的差異荷載 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m，合計 M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m。墩頂兩排臨時墊塊相距 4.0 m、總垂直力 N = 300×150 = 45,000 kN，單排反力 R = 22,500 ± 103,275/4.0 = 22,500 ± 25,819 kN，最小值約 −3,319 kN，表示需錨拉鋼棒。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"One 4 m segment cast ahead weighs W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN at a 72 m arm, giving 86,400 kN·m; a 2% differential dead load on one side adds 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m, for M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m. With two rows of temporary blocks 4.0 m apart and N = 300×150 = 45,000 kN, each row carries R = 22,500 ± 103,275/4.0 = 22,500 ± 25,819 kN; the minimum, about −3,319 kN, means tie-down bars are required. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity\", which statement holds?","options":["一側先澆 4 m 節塊 W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN，力臂 72 m，彎矩 86,400 kN·m。","掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。","線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。"],"optionsEn":["One 4 m segment cast ahead weighs W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN at a 72 m arm, giving 86,400 kN·m.","A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry.","Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"一側先澆 4 m 節塊 W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN，力臂 72 m，彎矩 86,400 kN·m；加上一側自重多 2% 的差異荷載 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m，合計 M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"One 4 m segment cast ahead weighs W = 300×4 = 1,200 kN at a 72 m arm, giving 86,400 kN·m; a 2% differential dead load on one side adds 0.02×300×75×37.5 ≈ 16,875 kN·m, for M_u ≈ 103,275 kN·m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b038-v13-07","title":"施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「墩頂臨時固結」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Temporary pier fixity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"臨時固結設計須列出每一種施工荷載組合下的墊塊壓力與錨拉鋼棒拉力，鋼棒以千斤頂壓力錶與伸長量雙重確認張拉值；懸臂施工期間定期量測兩側懸臂端高程差與墩頂傾斜，若傾斜趨勢與不平衡荷載預測不符，立即停止下一節塊作業。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"The temporary-fixity design must list block pressures and tie-down bar forces for every construction load combination; bars are verified by both jack gauge pressure and elongation. During cantilevering, survey the level difference between the two tips and the pier-top tilt regularly, and stop work on the next segment if the tilt trend does not match the unbalanced-load prediction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在施工計畫中明訂「最多領先一個節塊」與工地材料堆放區位置，臨時固結的拆除時機（通常在閉合並張拉連續鋼腱之後）列為設計單位簽認的停留點。","observationEn":"Site practice: The construction plan should state a rule of at most one segment ahead on either side and fix the locations of material stockpiles; the release of temporary fixity, normally after closure and continuity stressing, is a hold point signed off by the designer.","failure":"注意干擾：臨時錨拉鋼棒張拉不足、墊塊壓碎或提早拆除時，懸臂會繞墩頂轉動，一側下沉、另一側上翹，輕則閉合段高程無法對齊，重則整個 T 構傾覆；墩身在施工期承受的彎矩若未檢核，也可能在墩底出現水平裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If tie-down bars are under-stressed, blocks crush or fixity is released early, the cantilever rotates about the pier top, one tip dropping and the other rising; at best the closure cannot be aligned, at worst the whole T-frame overturns. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"臨時固結設計須列出每一種施工荷載組合下的墊塊壓力與錨拉鋼棒拉力，鋼棒以千斤頂壓力錶與伸長量雙重確認張拉值；懸臂施工期間定期量測兩側懸臂端高程差與墩頂傾斜，若傾斜趨勢與不平衡荷載預測不符，立即停止下一節塊作業。","textEn":"The temporary-fixity design must list block pressures and tie-down bar forces for every construction load combination; bars are verified by both jack gauge pressure and elongation. During cantilevering, survey the level difference between the two tips and the pier-top tilt regularly, and stop work on the next segment if the tilt trend does not match the unbalanced-load prediction.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在施工計畫中明訂「最多領先一個節塊」與工地材料堆放區位置，臨時固結的拆除時機（通常在閉合並張拉連續鋼腱之後）列為設計單位簽認的停留點。","textEn":"The construction plan should state a rule of at most one segment ahead on either side and fix the locations of material stockpiles; the release of temporary fixity, normally after closure and continuity stressing, is a hold point signed off by the designer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","臨時固結設計須列出每一種施工荷載組合下的墊塊壓力與錨拉鋼棒拉力，鋼棒以千斤頂壓力錶與伸長量雙重確認張拉值。","混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","The temporary-fixity design must list block pressures and tie-down bar forces for every construction load combination.","Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing."],"answer":1,"explanation":"臨時固結設計須列出每一種施工荷載組合下的墊塊壓力與錨拉鋼棒拉力，鋼棒以千斤頂壓力錶與伸長量雙重確認張拉值；懸臂施工期間定期量測兩側懸臂端高程差與墩頂傾斜，若傾斜趨勢與不平衡荷載預測不符，立即停止下一節塊作業。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"The temporary-fixity design must list block pressures and tie-down bar forces for every construction load combination; bars are verified by both jack gauge pressure and elongation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b038-v13-08","title":"施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結：失效診斷","titleEn":"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「墩頂臨時固結」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Temporary pier fixity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"臨時錨拉鋼棒張拉不足、墊塊壓碎或提早拆除時，懸臂會繞墩頂轉動，一側下沉、另一側上翹，輕則閉合段高程無法對齊，重則整個 T 構傾覆；墩身在施工期承受的彎矩若未檢核，也可能在墩底出現水平裂縫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If tie-down bars are under-stressed, blocks crush or fixity is released early, the cantilever rotates about the pier top, one tip dropping and the other rising; at best the closure cannot be aligned, at worst the whole T-frame overturns. Pier bending during construction, if not checked, can also crack the pier base horizontally. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：分段橋設計規範要求檢核差異自重、施工活載、施工機具與節塊意外釋放等施工荷載組合。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Segmental design provisions require construction load combinations covering differential dead load, construction live load, equipment and accidental release of a segment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"臨時錨拉鋼棒張拉不足、墊塊壓碎或提早拆除時，懸臂會繞墩頂轉動，一側下沉、另一側上翹，輕則閉合段高程無法對齊，重則整個 T 構傾覆；墩身在施工期承受的彎矩若未檢核，也可能在墩底出現水平裂縫。","textEn":"If tie-down bars are under-stressed, blocks crush or fixity is released early, the cantilever rotates about the pier top, one tip dropping and the other rising; at best the closure cannot be aligned, at worst the whole T-frame overturns. Pier bending during construction, if not checked, can also crack the pier base horizontally.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「施工期不平衡荷載與臨時固結」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Construction-stage unbalanced loads and temporary fixity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。","臨時錨拉鋼棒張拉不足、墊塊壓碎或提早拆除時，懸臂會繞墩頂轉動，一側下沉、另一側上翹，輕則閉合段高程無法對齊，重則整個 T 構傾覆。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.","If tie-down bars are under-stressed, blocks crush or fixity is released early, the cantilever rotates about the pier top, one tip dropping and the other rising."],"answer":2,"explanation":"臨時錨拉鋼棒張拉不足、墊塊壓碎或提早拆除時，懸臂會繞墩頂轉動，一側下沉、另一側上翹，輕則閉合段高程無法對齊，重則整個 T 構傾覆；墩身在施工期承受的彎矩若未檢核，也可能在墩底出現水平裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If tie-down bars are under-stressed, blocks crush or fixity is released early, the cantilever rotates about the pier top, one tip dropping and the other rising; at best the closure cannot be aligned, at worst the whole T-frame overturns. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b038-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱」與「現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons\" and \"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b038-v13-09","title":"懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「頂板懸臂鋼腱」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Top-slab cantilever tendons” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"每加一對節塊，就在頂板張拉一對懸臂鋼腱，錨定在該節塊端面，使鋼腱數量由懸臂末端往墩頂逐漸累積，正好呼應彎矩向墩頂遞增。閉合後在底板張拉連續鋼腱，錨定在箱內齒塊上，以承受跨中正彎矩；現代設計常再加體外鋼腱，經轉向塊彎折，便於日後檢查與更換。錨碇區承受極大的集中力，需配置抵抗劈裂與爆裂的螺旋筋與格狀鋼筋。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「頂板懸臂鋼腱」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each new segment pair receives a pair of top-slab cantilever tendons anchored at its end face, so the tendon count accumulates from the tip towards the pier, matching the moment growth. After closure, continuity tendons in the bottom slab, anchored on blisters inside the box, resist midspan sagging moment; modern designs often add external tendons deviated at deviator blocks so they can be inspected and replaced later. Anchorage zones carry huge concentrated forces and need spiral and orthogonal reinforcement against bursting and spalling. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Top-slab cantilever tendons” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以 19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線為一束：A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²，f_pu = 1,860 MPa，千斤頂力 P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Take a 19-strand 15.2 mm tendon: A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm², f_pu = 1,860 MPa, jacking force P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「頂板懸臂鋼腱」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Top-slab cantilever tendons”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-09-k1","title":"懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱","titleEn":"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons","text":"每加一對節塊，就在頂板張拉一對懸臂鋼腱，錨定在該節塊端面，使鋼腱數量由懸臂末端往墩頂逐漸累積，正好呼應彎矩向墩頂遞增。閉合後在底板張拉連續鋼腱，錨定在箱內齒塊上，以承受跨中正彎矩；現代設計常再加體外鋼腱，經轉向塊彎折，便於日後檢查與更換。","textEn":"Each new segment pair receives a pair of top-slab cantilever tendons anchored at its end face, so the tendon count accumulates from the tip towards the pier, matching the moment growth. After closure, continuity tendons in the bottom slab, anchored on blisters inside the box, resist midspan sagging moment; modern designs often add external tendons deviated at deviator blocks so they can be inspected and replaced later.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons\" is correct?","options":["每加一對節塊，就在頂板張拉一對懸臂鋼腱，錨定在該節塊端面，使鋼腱數量由懸臂末端往墩頂逐漸累積，正好呼應彎矩向墩頂遞增。","懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。","預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。"],"optionsEn":["Each new segment pair receives a pair of top-slab cantilever tendons anchored at its end face, so the tendon count accumulates from the tip towards the pier, matching the moment growth.","Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.","The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每加一對節塊，就在頂板張拉一對懸臂鋼腱，錨定在該節塊端面，使鋼腱數量由懸臂末端往墩頂逐漸累積，正好呼應彎矩向墩頂遞增。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each new segment pair receives a pair of top-slab cantilever tendons anchored at its end face, so the tendon count accumulates from the tip towards the pier, matching the moment growth. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b038-v13-10","title":"懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱：定量估算","titleEn":"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「頂板懸臂鋼腱」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Top-slab cantilever tendons” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以 19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線為一束：A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²，f_pu = 1,860 MPa，千斤頂力 P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN。扣除損失後每束取 3,200 kN，墩頂需要 127,500/3,200 ≈ 40 束，約每對節塊增加 2 至 3 束。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Take a 19-strand 15.2 mm tendon: A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm², f_pu = 1,860 MPa, jacking force P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN. Allowing for losses at 3,200 kN per tendon, the pier section needs 127,500/3,200 ≈ 40 tendons, roughly 2 to 3 more for each segment pair. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對每一節塊端面的鋼腱數量與錨碇位置是否與鋼腱配置圖一致，錨碇區鋼筋於澆置前由監造逐項檢查；錨具與夾片須有系統認證與批次試驗報告，錨碇區混凝土在張拉時必須達到設計規定的最低強度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check that the tendon count and anchor positions at each segment face match the tendon layout drawings, and have the supervising engineer inspect anchorage-zone reinforcement item by item before casting; anchors and wedges need system approval and lot test reports, and the anchorage concrete must reach the specified minimum strength before stressing.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以 19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線為一束：A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²，f_pu = 1,860 MPa，千斤頂力 P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN。扣除損失後每束取 3,200 kN，墩頂需要 127,500/3,200 ≈ 40 束，約每對節塊增加 2 至 3 束。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Take a 19-strand 15.2 mm tendon: A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm², f_pu = 1,860 MPa, jacking force P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN. Allowing for losses at 3,200 kN per tendon, the pier section needs 127,500/3,200 ≈ 40 tendons, roughly 2 to 3 more for each segment pair. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons\", which statement holds?","options":["只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。","以 19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線為一束：A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²，f_pu = 1,860 MPa，千斤頂力 P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN。","千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。"],"optionsEn":["Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.","Take a 19-strand 15.2 mm tendon: A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm², f_pu = 1,860 MPa, jacking force P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN.","If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線為一束：A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²，f_pu = 1,860 MPa，千斤頂力 P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Take a 19-strand 15.2 mm tendon: A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm², f_pu = 1,860 MPa, jacking force P_j = 0.75×1,860×2,660 ≈ 3,711 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b038-v13-11","title":"懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「頂板懸臂鋼腱」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Top-slab cantilever tendons” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對每一節塊端面的鋼腱數量與錨碇位置是否與鋼腱配置圖一致，錨碇區鋼筋於澆置前由監造逐項檢查；錨具與夾片須有系統認證與批次試驗報告，錨碇區混凝土在張拉時必須達到設計規定的最低強度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check that the tendon count and anchor positions at each segment face match the tendon layout drawings, and have the supervising engineer inspect anchorage-zone reinforcement item by item before casting; anchors and wedges need system approval and lot test reports, and the anchorage concrete must reach the specified minimum strength before stressing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：鋼腱配置圖要同時標示孔道座標、錨碇編號與張拉順序，並要求承包商在澆置前以孔道通球或通索確認暢通；預留空孔道與錨碇作為未來補強之用，並在竣工圖上清楚標示。","observationEn":"Site practice: Tendon drawings should show duct coordinates, anchor numbers and stressing order, and the contractor should prove each duct clear with a pig or trial strand before casting; spare ducts and anchorages for future strengthening are provided and clearly marked on the as-built drawings.","failure":"注意干擾：錨碇區鋼筋不足或混凝土強度未達就張拉，會在錨墊板後方產生縱向劈裂裂縫，甚至錨具陷入；鋼腱孔道灌漿不實則讓水氣與氯離子沿孔道進入，長期造成鋼絞線腐蝕斷絲，這是體內鋼腱難以檢查的主要隱患。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Insufficient anchorage-zone reinforcement or stressing before the concrete reaches strength causes longitudinal splitting behind the bearing plate or even anchor punch-through; voids in duct grout let moisture and chlorides travel along the duct and corrode strands over the years, the main hidden risk of internal tendons that cannot be inspected easily. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對每一節塊端面的鋼腱數量與錨碇位置是否與鋼腱配置圖一致，錨碇區鋼筋於澆置前由監造逐項檢查；錨具與夾片須有系統認證與批次試驗報告，錨碇區混凝土在張拉時必須達到設計規定的最低強度。","textEn":"Check that the tendon count and anchor positions at each segment face match the tendon layout drawings, and have the supervising engineer inspect anchorage-zone reinforcement item by item before casting; anchors and wedges need system approval and lot test reports, and the anchorage concrete must reach the specified minimum strength before stressing.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"鋼腱配置圖要同時標示孔道座標、錨碇編號與張拉順序，並要求承包商在澆置前以孔道通球或通索確認暢通；預留空孔道與錨碇作為未來補強之用，並在竣工圖上清楚標示。","textEn":"Tendon drawings should show duct coordinates, anchor numbers and stressing order, and the contractor should prove each duct clear with a pig or trial strand before casting; spare ducts and anchorages for future strengthening are provided and clearly marked on the as-built drawings.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。","核對每一節塊端面的鋼腱數量與錨碇位置是否與鋼腱配置圖一致，錨碇區鋼筋於澆置前由監造逐項檢查。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection.","Check that the tendon count and anchor positions at each segment face match the tendon layout drawings, and have the supervising engineer inspect anchorage-zone reinforcement item by item before casting."],"answer":2,"explanation":"核對每一節塊端面的鋼腱數量與錨碇位置是否與鋼腱配置圖一致，錨碇區鋼筋於澆置前由監造逐項檢查；錨具與夾片須有系統認證與批次試驗報告，錨碇區混凝土在張拉時必須達到設計規定的最低強度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check that the tendon count and anchor positions at each segment face match the tendon layout drawings, and have the supervising engineer inspect anchorage-zone reinforcement item by item before casting; anchors and wedges need system approval and lot test reports, and the anchorage concrete must reach the specified minimum strength before stressing. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b038-v13-12","title":"懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「頂板懸臂鋼腱」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Top-slab cantilever tendons” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"錨碇區鋼筋不足或混凝土強度未達就張拉，會在錨墊板後方產生縱向劈裂裂縫，甚至錨具陷入；鋼腱孔道灌漿不實則讓水氣與氯離子沿孔道進入，長期造成鋼絞線腐蝕斷絲，這是體內鋼腱難以檢查的主要隱患。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Insufficient anchorage-zone reinforcement or stressing before the concrete reaches strength causes longitudinal splitting behind the bearing plate or even anchor punch-through; voids in duct grout let moisture and chlorides travel along the duct and corrode strands over the years, the main hidden risk of internal tendons that cannot be inspected easily. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：錨碇區承受極大的集中力，需配置抵抗劈裂與爆裂的螺旋筋與格狀鋼筋。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Anchorage zones carry huge concentrated forces and need spiral and orthogonal reinforcement against bursting and spalling.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"錨碇區鋼筋不足或混凝土強度未達就張拉，會在錨墊板後方產生縱向劈裂裂縫，甚至錨具陷入；鋼腱孔道灌漿不實則讓水氣與氯離子沿孔道進入，長期造成鋼絞線腐蝕斷絲，這是體內鋼腱難以檢查的主要隱患。","textEn":"Insufficient anchorage-zone reinforcement or stressing before the concrete reaches strength causes longitudinal splitting behind the bearing plate or even anchor punch-through; voids in duct grout let moisture and chlorides travel along the duct and corrode strands over the years, the main hidden risk of internal tendons that cannot be inspected easily.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「懸臂鋼腱、錨碇與連續鋼腱」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cantilever tendons, anchorages and continuity tendons\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["錨碇區鋼筋不足或混凝土強度未達就張拉，會在錨墊板後方產生縱向劈裂裂縫，甚至錨具陷入。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。"],"optionsEn":["Insufficient anchorage-zone reinforcement or stressing before the concrete reaches strength causes longitudinal splitting behind the bearing plate or even anchor punch-through.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"錨碇區鋼筋不足或混凝土強度未達就張拉，會在錨墊板後方產生縱向劈裂裂縫，甚至錨具陷入；鋼腱孔道灌漿不實則讓水氣與氯離子沿孔道進入，長期造成鋼絞線腐蝕斷絲，這是體內鋼腱難以檢查的主要隱患。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Insufficient anchorage-zone reinforcement or stressing before the concrete reaches strength causes longitudinal splitting behind the bearing plate or even anchor punch-through; voids in duct grout let moisture and chlorides travel along the duct and corrode strands over the years, the main hidden risk of internal tendons that cannot be inspected easily. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b038-v13-13","title":"現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「剪力鍵與節塊接縫」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Shear keys and segment joints” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"場鑄平衡懸臂的節塊接縫是施工縫：前一節塊端面打毛、普通鋼筋連續穿過，新混凝土直接澆在舊混凝土上。預鑄平衡懸臂則採匹配澆注：新節塊緊貼前一節塊澆製，使兩者端面完全吻合，安裝時以環氧樹脂接縫與多重剪力鍵傳遞剪力，接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，完全靠預力壓緊。因此預鑄接縫在任何施工與營運階段都不容許拉應力，剪力鍵的幾何與環氧樹脂的擠壓品質直接決定接縫剪力強度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「剪力鍵與節塊接縫」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In cast-in-place balanced cantilevers the segment joint is a construction joint: the previous end face is roughened, ordinary reinforcement runs through, and new concrete is cast against old. Precast balanced cantilevers use match casting: each new segment is cast against the previous one so the faces fit exactly, and at erection epoxy joints and multiple shear keys transfer shear with no continuous reinforcement, held closed only by prestress. Precast joints therefore allow no tension at any construction or service stage, and shear-key geometry and the quality of epoxy squeeze-out govern joint shear strength. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Shear keys and segment joints” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：環氧接縫固化期間以臨時預力棒維持平均壓應力 0.28 MPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: While the epoxy cures, temporary bars maintain an average joint compression of 0.28 MPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「剪力鍵與節塊接縫」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Shear keys and segment joints”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-13-k1","title":"現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫","titleEn":"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints","text":"場鑄平衡懸臂的節塊接縫是施工縫：前一節塊端面打毛、普通鋼筋連續穿過，新混凝土直接澆在舊混凝土上。預鑄平衡懸臂則採匹配澆注：新節塊緊貼前一節塊澆製，使兩者端面完全吻合，安裝時以環氧樹脂接縫與多重剪力鍵傳遞剪力，接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，完全靠預力壓緊。","textEn":"In cast-in-place balanced cantilevers the segment joint is a construction joint: the previous end face is roughened, ordinary reinforcement runs through, and new concrete is cast against old. Precast balanced cantilevers use match casting: each new segment is cast against the previous one so the faces fit exactly, and at erection epoxy joints and multiple shear keys transfer shear with no continuous reinforcement, held closed only by prestress.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints\" is correct?","options":["預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。","場鑄平衡懸臂的節塊接縫是施工縫：前一節塊端面打毛、普通鋼筋連續穿過，新混凝土直接澆在舊混凝土上。","掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。"],"optionsEn":["The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion.","In cast-in-place balanced cantilevers the segment joint is a construction joint: the previous end face is roughened, ordinary reinforcement runs through, and new concrete is cast against old.","A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry."],"answer":1,"explanation":"場鑄平衡懸臂的節塊接縫是施工縫：前一節塊端面打毛、普通鋼筋連續穿過，新混凝土直接澆在舊混凝土上。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In cast-in-place balanced cantilevers the segment joint is a construction joint: the previous end face is roughened, ordinary reinforcement runs through, and new concrete is cast against old. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b038-v13-14","title":"現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫：定量估算","titleEn":"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「剪力鍵與節塊接縫」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Shear keys and segment joints” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：環氧接縫固化期間以臨時預力棒維持平均壓應力 0.28 MPa。端面淨面積 8 m² 時，所需壓力 F = 0.28×8×10⁶ N = 2,240 kN；每支 36 mm 鋼棒施加 600 kN，需 2,240/600 ≈ 3.7，取 4 支並對稱配置。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: While the epoxy cures, temporary bars maintain an average joint compression of 0.28 MPa. For a net face area of 8 m², the required force is F = 0.28×8×10⁶ N = 2,240 kN; at 600 kN per 36 mm bar, 2,240/600 ≈ 3.7, so use 4 bars placed symmetrically. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：場鑄接縫在澆置前檢查打毛深度、清潔與濕潤狀態；預鑄接縫在安裝前做乾接合試拼，確認剪力鍵密合，塗佈環氧後檢查擠出是否沿全周連續，並保存環氧批號、適用時間與環境溫度紀錄，固化試體強度與規格比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: For cast joints, inspect roughening depth, cleanliness and moisture before casting; for precast joints, do a dry fit before erection to confirm shear-key seating, check that epoxy squeeze-out is continuous around the perimeter, and record epoxy lot, pot life and ambient temperature, comparing cured specimen strength with the specification.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"環氧接縫固化期間以臨時預力棒維持平均壓應力 0.28 MPa。端面淨面積 8 m² 時，所需壓力 F = 0.28×8×10⁶ N = 2,240 kN；每支 36 mm 鋼棒施加 600 kN，需 2,240/600 ≈ 3.7，取 4 支並對稱配置。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"While the epoxy cures, temporary bars maintain an average joint compression of 0.28 MPa. For a net face area of 8 m², the required force is F = 0.28×8×10⁶ N = 2,240 kN; at 600 kN per 36 mm bar, 2,240/600 ≈ 3.7, so use 4 bars placed symmetrically. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints\", which statement holds?","options":["線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。","混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。","環氧接縫固化期間以臨時預力棒維持平均壓應力 0.28 MPa。"],"optionsEn":["Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure.","Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.","While the epoxy cures, temporary bars maintain an average joint compression of 0.28 MPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"環氧接縫固化期間以臨時預力棒維持平均壓應力 0.28 MPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"While the epoxy cures, temporary bars maintain an average joint compression of 0.28 MPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b038-v13-15","title":"現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「剪力鍵與節塊接縫」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Shear keys and segment joints” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"場鑄接縫在澆置前檢查打毛深度、清潔與濕潤狀態；預鑄接縫在安裝前做乾接合試拼，確認剪力鍵密合，塗佈環氧後檢查擠出是否沿全周連續，並保存環氧批號、適用時間與環境溫度紀錄，固化試體強度與規格比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"For cast joints, inspect roughening depth, cleanliness and moisture before casting; for precast joints, do a dry fit before erection to confirm shear-key seating, check that epoxy squeeze-out is continuous around the perimeter, and record epoxy lot, pot life and ambient temperature, comparing cured specimen strength with the specification. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：規格中寫明環氧材料的適用溫度範圍、最長開放時間與最低臨時壓應力；低溫或下雨時停止接縫作業，並由監造在每一接縫完成後簽署檢查紀錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: The specification should state the epoxy's temperature range, maximum open time and minimum temporary compression; stop jointing in cold or rain, and have the supervising engineer sign an inspection record for every completed joint.","failure":"注意干擾：環氧塗佈後超過適用時間才合攏，或臨時預力不足，接縫會留下未擠實的空隙，日後成為水分進入孔道的通道；匹配澆注時若剪力鍵破損仍強行安裝，接縫局部承壓不均，可能在預力張拉時崩角。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Closing the joint after the epoxy's pot life has expired, or with too little temporary prestress, leaves unfilled voids that later let water reach the ducts; forcing a segment with damaged shear keys into place causes uneven bearing that can spall corners during stressing. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"場鑄接縫在澆置前檢查打毛深度、清潔與濕潤狀態；預鑄接縫在安裝前做乾接合試拼，確認剪力鍵密合，塗佈環氧後檢查擠出是否沿全周連續，並保存環氧批號、適用時間與環境溫度紀錄，固化試體強度與規格比對。","textEn":"For cast joints, inspect roughening depth, cleanliness and moisture before casting; for precast joints, do a dry fit before erection to confirm shear-key seating, check that epoxy squeeze-out is continuous around the perimeter, and record epoxy lot, pot life and ambient temperature, comparing cured specimen strength with the specification.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"規格中寫明環氧材料的適用溫度範圍、最長開放時間與最低臨時壓應力；低溫或下雨時停止接縫作業，並由監造在每一接縫完成後簽署檢查紀錄。","textEn":"The specification should state the epoxy's temperature range, maximum open time and minimum temporary compression; stop jointing in cold or rain, and have the supervising engineer sign an inspection record for every completed joint.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints\"?","options":["場鑄接縫在澆置前檢查打毛深度、清潔與濕潤狀態。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。"],"optionsEn":["For cast joints, inspect roughening depth, cleanliness and moisture before casting.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough."],"answer":0,"explanation":"場鑄接縫在澆置前檢查打毛深度、清潔與濕潤狀態；預鑄接縫在安裝前做乾接合試拼，確認剪力鍵密合，塗佈環氧後檢查擠出是否沿全周連續，並保存環氧批號、適用時間與環境溫度紀錄，固化試體強度與規格比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"For cast joints, inspect roughening depth, cleanliness and moisture before casting; for precast joints, do a dry fit before erection to confirm shear-key seating, check that epoxy squeeze-out is continuous around the perimeter, and record epoxy lot, pot life and ambient temperature, comparing cured specimen strength with the specification. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b038-v13-16","title":"現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「剪力鍵與節塊接縫」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Shear keys and segment joints” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"環氧塗佈後超過適用時間才合攏，或臨時預力不足，接縫會留下未擠實的空隙，日後成為水分進入孔道的通道；匹配澆注時若剪力鍵破損仍強行安裝，接縫局部承壓不均，可能在預力張拉時崩角。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Closing the joint after the epoxy's pot life has expired, or with too little temporary prestress, leaves unfilled voids that later let water reach the ducts; forcing a segment with damaged shear keys into place causes uneven bearing that can spall corners during stressing. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因此預鑄接縫在任何施工與營運階段都不容許拉應力，剪力鍵的幾何與環氧樹脂的擠壓品質直接決定接縫剪力強度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Precast joints therefore allow no tension at any construction or service stage, and shear-key geometry and the quality of epoxy squeeze-out govern joint shear strength.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"環氧塗佈後超過適用時間才合攏，或臨時預力不足，接縫會留下未擠實的空隙，日後成為水分進入孔道的通道；匹配澆注時若剪力鍵破損仍強行安裝，接縫局部承壓不均，可能在預力張拉時崩角。","textEn":"Closing the joint after the epoxy's pot life has expired, or with too little temporary prestress, leaves unfilled voids that later let water reach the ducts; forcing a segment with damaged shear keys into place causes uneven bearing that can spall corners during stressing.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「現澆施工縫與匹配澆注接縫」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cast-in-place joints and match-cast joints\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","環氧塗佈後超過適用時間才合攏，或臨時預力不足，接縫會留下未擠實的空隙，日後成為水分進入孔道的通道。","掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Closing the joint after the epoxy's pot life has expired, or with too little temporary prestress, leaves unfilled voids that later let water reach the ducts.","A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry."],"answer":1,"explanation":"環氧塗佈後超過適用時間才合攏，或臨時預力不足，接縫會留下未擠實的空隙，日後成為水分進入孔道的通道；匹配澆注時若剪力鍵破損仍強行安裝，接縫局部承壓不均，可能在預力張拉時崩角。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Closing the joint after the epoxy's pot life has expired, or with too little temporary prestress, leaves unfilled voids that later let water reach the ducts; forcing a segment with damaged shear keys into place causes uneven bearing that can spall corners during stressing. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b038-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環」與「預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Form travelers and the segment cycle\" and \"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b038-v13-17","title":"懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Form travelers and the segment cycle: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「懸臂工作車循環」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Form-traveler cycle” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"場鑄懸臂由懸臂工作車（掛籃）在已完成節塊的端部承托模板與新混凝土，循環為：工作車前移與錨定、調整模板高程、綁紮鋼筋與佈設孔道、澆置、養護、達到張拉強度後張拉懸臂鋼腱、拆模再前移。工作車重量通常約為節塊重量的一半，它本身也是懸臂結構，濕混凝土澆入時會下撓，必須預先抬高模板。整個工期的節奏由混凝土達到張拉強度所需的時間決定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「懸臂工作車循環」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In cast-in-place cantilevering, a form traveler anchored to the end of the completed segment carries the formwork and fresh concrete. The cycle is: advance and anchor the traveler, set form levels, place reinforcement and ducts, cast, cure, stress the cantilever tendons once the concrete reaches stressing strength, strip and advance again. A traveler often weighs about half a segment and is itself a cantilever that deflects as wet concrete is placed, so forms must be pre-raised. The pace of the whole job is set by how fast the concrete reaches stressing strength. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Form-traveler cycle” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：依 ACI 209 強度發展 f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: ACI 209 strength gain f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t).","failure":"常見誤解：「掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「懸臂工作車循環」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Form-traveler cycle”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-17-k1","title":"懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環","titleEn":"Form travelers and the segment cycle","text":"場鑄懸臂由懸臂工作車（掛籃）在已完成節塊的端部承托模板與新混凝土，循環為：工作車前移與錨定、調整模板高程、綁紮鋼筋與佈設孔道、澆置、養護、達到張拉強度後張拉懸臂鋼腱、拆模再前移。工作車重量通常約為節塊重量的一半，它本身也是懸臂結構，濕混凝土澆入時會下撓，必須預先抬高模板。","textEn":"In cast-in-place cantilevering, a form traveler anchored to the end of the completed segment carries the formwork and fresh concrete. The cycle is: advance and anchor the traveler, set form levels, place reinforcement and ducts, cast, cure, stress the cantilever tendons once the concrete reaches stressing strength, strip and advance again.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Form travelers and the segment cycle\" is correct?","options":["掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。","只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。","場鑄懸臂由懸臂工作車（掛籃）在已完成節塊的端部承托模板與新混凝土，循環為：工作車前移與錨定、調整模板高程、綁紮鋼筋與佈設孔道、澆置、養護、達到張拉強度後張拉懸臂鋼腱、拆模再前移。"],"optionsEn":["A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry.","Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.","In cast-in-place cantilevering, a form traveler anchored to the end of the completed segment carries the formwork and fresh concrete."],"answer":2,"explanation":"場鑄懸臂由懸臂工作車（掛籃）在已完成節塊的端部承托模板與新混凝土，循環為：工作車前移與錨定、調整模板高程、綁紮鋼筋與佈設孔道、澆置、養護、達到張拉強度後張拉懸臂鋼腱、拆模再前移。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In cast-in-place cantilevering, a form traveler anchored to the end of the completed segment carries the formwork and fresh concrete. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b038-v13-18","title":"懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環：定量估算","titleEn":"Form travelers and the segment cycle: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「懸臂工作車循環」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Form-traveler cycle” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：依 ACI 209 強度發展 f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t)。f₂₈ = 50 MPa、張拉需 30 MPa（比值 0.6）：第 I 型水泥 a = 4、b = 0.85，t = 0.6×4/(1 − 0.6×0.85) ≈ 4.9 天；早強水泥 a = 2.3、b = 0.92，t ≈ 3.1 天。懸臂 69 m 分為 18 節塊時，每節塊省 1.8 天可縮短約 32 天。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: ACI 209 strength gain f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t). With f₂₈ = 50 MPa and 30 MPa needed for stressing (ratio 0.6), Type I cement (a = 4, b = 0.85) gives t = 0.6×4/(1 − 0.6×0.85) ≈ 4.9 days; high-early cement (a = 2.3, b = 0.92) gives t ≈ 3.1 days. With a 69 m cantilever in 18 segments, saving 1.8 days per segment shortens the work by about 32 days. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：張拉前以與節塊同條件養護的圓柱試體確認強度，並以成熟度感測器輔助判斷；工作車首次使用前做載重試驗（例如以水袋或配重加載至設計荷重），量測撓度與錨定桿受力，建立濕混凝土撓度的修正值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before stressing, confirm strength with cylinders cured alongside the segment, supported by maturity sensors; before first use, load-test the traveler with water bags or ballast to its design load, measuring deflection and anchor-rod forces to establish the wet-concrete deflection correction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"依 ACI 209 強度發展 f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t)。f₂₈ = 50 MPa、張拉需 30 MPa（比值 0.6）：第 I 型水泥 a = 4、b = 0.85，t = 0.6×4/(1 − 0.6×0.85) ≈ 4.9 天；早強水泥 a = 2.3、b = 0.92，t ≈ 3.1 天。懸臂 69 m 分為 18 節塊時，每節塊省 1.8 天可縮短約 32 天。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"ACI 209 strength gain f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t). With f₂₈ = 50 MPa and 30 MPa needed for stressing (ratio 0.6), Type I cement (a = 4, b = 0.85) gives t = 0.6×4/(1 − 0.6×0.85) ≈ 4.9 days; high-early cement (a = 2.3, b = 0.92) gives t ≈ 3.1 days. With a 69 m cantilever in 18 segments, saving 1.8 days per segment shortens the work by about 32 days. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Form travelers and the segment cycle\", which statement holds?","options":["依 ACI 209 強度發展 f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t)。","千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。","預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。"],"optionsEn":["ACI 209 strength gain f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t).","If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress.","The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"依 ACI 209 強度發展 f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"ACI 209 strength gain f(t) = f₂₈·t/(a + b·t). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b038-v13-19","title":"懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Form travelers and the segment cycle: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「懸臂工作車循環」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Form-traveler cycle” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"張拉前以與節塊同條件養護的圓柱試體確認強度，並以成熟度感測器輔助判斷；工作車首次使用前做載重試驗（例如以水袋或配重加載至設計荷重），量測撓度與錨定桿受力，建立濕混凝土撓度的修正值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before stressing, confirm strength with cylinders cured alongside the segment, supported by maturity sensors; before first use, load-test the traveler with water bags or ballast to its design load, measuring deflection and anchor-rod forces to establish the wet-concrete deflection correction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：工作車的設計、組立、載重試驗與每次前移後的錨定檢查應由專業技師簽認，前移作業列為停留點；每一循環的張拉放行條件（試體強度與錨定檢查）以表單管理，不得口頭放行。","observationEn":"Site practice: Traveler design, assembly, load test and anchorage check after each advance must be signed by a qualified engineer, with every advance a hold point; release for stressing in each cycle (cylinder strength and anchorage check) is managed by a signed form, never verbally.","failure":"注意干擾：工作車後錨桿鬆脫或錨定於強度不足的混凝土時，工作車可能整體前傾墜落；若為趕工在強度未達時張拉，錨碇區崩裂與過大潛變撓度都會出現，事後只能鑿除修補並重新評估線形。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If a traveler's rear anchor rods loosen or are anchored in under-strength concrete, the traveler can tip forward and fall; stressing early to save time causes anchorage cracking and excessive creep deflection, leaving only demolition, repair and a re-evaluated geometry. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"張拉前以與節塊同條件養護的圓柱試體確認強度，並以成熟度感測器輔助判斷；工作車首次使用前做載重試驗（例如以水袋或配重加載至設計荷重），量測撓度與錨定桿受力，建立濕混凝土撓度的修正值。","textEn":"Before stressing, confirm strength with cylinders cured alongside the segment, supported by maturity sensors; before first use, load-test the traveler with water bags or ballast to its design load, measuring deflection and anchor-rod forces to establish the wet-concrete deflection correction.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"工作車的設計、組立、載重試驗與每次前移後的錨定檢查應由專業技師簽認，前移作業列為停留點；每一循環的張拉放行條件（試體強度與錨定檢查）以表單管理，不得口頭放行。","textEn":"Traveler design, assembly, load test and anchorage check after each advance must be signed by a qualified engineer, with every advance a hold point; release for stressing in each cycle (cylinder strength and anchorage check) is managed by a signed form, never verbally.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Form travelers and the segment cycle\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","張拉前以與節塊同條件養護的圓柱試體確認強度，並以成熟度感測器輔助判斷。","只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before stressing, confirm strength with cylinders cured alongside the segment, supported by maturity sensors.","If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier."],"answer":1,"explanation":"張拉前以與節塊同條件養護的圓柱試體確認強度，並以成熟度感測器輔助判斷；工作車首次使用前做載重試驗（例如以水袋或配重加載至設計荷重），量測撓度與錨定桿受力，建立濕混凝土撓度的修正值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before stressing, confirm strength with cylinders cured alongside the segment, supported by maturity sensors; before first use, load-test the traveler with water bags or ballast to its design load, measuring deflection and anchor-rod forces to establish the wet-concrete deflection correction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b038-v13-20","title":"懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環：失效診斷","titleEn":"Form travelers and the segment cycle: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「懸臂工作車循環」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Form-traveler cycle” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"工作車後錨桿鬆脫或錨定於強度不足的混凝土時，工作車可能整體前傾墜落；若為趕工在強度未達時張拉，錨碇區崩裂與過大潛變撓度都會出現，事後只能鑿除修補並重新評估線形。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If a traveler's rear anchor rods loosen or are anchored in under-strength concrete, the traveler can tip forward and fall; stressing early to save time causes anchorage cracking and excessive creep deflection, leaving only demolition, repair and a re-evaluated geometry. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：整個工期的節奏由混凝土達到張拉強度所需的時間決定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The pace of the whole job is set by how fast the concrete reaches stressing strength.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"工作車後錨桿鬆脫或錨定於強度不足的混凝土時，工作車可能整體前傾墜落；若為趕工在強度未達時張拉，錨碇區崩裂與過大潛變撓度都會出現，事後只能鑿除修補並重新評估線形。","textEn":"If a traveler's rear anchor rods loosen or are anchored in under-strength concrete, the traveler can tip forward and fall; stressing early to save time causes anchorage cracking and excessive creep deflection, leaving only demolition, repair and a re-evaluated geometry.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「懸臂工作車與節塊施工循環」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Form travelers and the segment cycle\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。","工作車後錨桿鬆脫或錨定於強度不足的混凝土時，工作車可能整體前傾墜落；若為趕工在強度未達時張拉，錨碇區崩裂與過大潛變撓度都會出現，事後只能鑿除修補並重新評估線形。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.","If a traveler's rear anchor rods loosen or are anchored in under-strength concrete, the traveler can tip forward and fall."],"answer":2,"explanation":"工作車後錨桿鬆脫或錨定於強度不足的混凝土時，工作車可能整體前傾墜落；若為趕工在強度未達時張拉，錨碇區崩裂與過大潛變撓度都會出現，事後只能鑿除修補並重新評估線形。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If a traveler's rear anchor rods loosen or are anchored in under-strength concrete, the traveler can tip forward and fall; stressing early to save time causes anchorage cracking and excessive creep deflection, leaving only demolition, repair and a re-evaluated geometry. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b038-v13-21","title":"預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「閉合段與預拱線形」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Closure segment and camber” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"每一節塊的澆置高程等於完工縱斷面再加上預拱值，預拱抵銷之後所有會發生的變形：後續節塊自重、預力上拱、工作車移除、閉合與連續鋼腱、鋪面荷重，以及多年的潛變與乾縮。日照使頂板比底板熱，懸臂端會在白天上翹、夜間回落，所以測量與閉合都安排在溫度穩定的清晨。閉合時先以鋼支撐或型鋼骨架把兩懸臂端鎖住，再於一天最低溫時澆置閉合段，使混凝土硬化時兩端不再相對移動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「閉合段與預拱線形」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each segment's casting elevation is the final profile plus a camber that offsets every later deformation: the weight of later segments, prestress uplift, traveler removal, closure and continuity tendons, surfacing loads, and years of creep and shrinkage. Sun heats the top slab more than the bottom, so cantilever tips rise by day and drop at night; survey and closure are therefore scheduled in the stable early morning. At closure, steel struts or a stiff skeleton first lock the two tips together, and the closure segment is cast at the day's lowest temperature so the tips no longer move relative to each other while the concrete hardens. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Closure segment and camber” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：線性溫差造成曲率 κ = α·ΔT/h，懸臂端撓度 δ = κ·L²/2。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A linear temperature difference gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/h and tip deflection δ = κ·L²/2.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「閉合段與預拱線形」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Closure segment and camber”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-21-k1","title":"預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合","titleEn":"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure","text":"每一節塊的澆置高程等於完工縱斷面再加上預拱值，預拱抵銷之後所有會發生的變形：後續節塊自重、預力上拱、工作車移除、閉合與連續鋼腱、鋪面荷重，以及多年的潛變與乾縮。日照使頂板比底板熱，懸臂端會在白天上翹、夜間回落，所以測量與閉合都安排在溫度穩定的清晨。","textEn":"Each segment's casting elevation is the final profile plus a camber that offsets every later deformation: the weight of later segments, prestress uplift, traveler removal, closure and continuity tendons, surfacing loads, and years of creep and shrinkage. Sun heats the top slab more than the bottom, so cantilever tips rise by day and drop at night; survey and closure are therefore scheduled in the stable early morning.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure\" is correct?","options":["每一節塊的澆置高程等於完工縱斷面再加上預拱值，預拱抵銷之後所有會發生的變形：後續節塊自重、預力上拱、工作車移除、閉合與連續鋼腱、鋪面荷重，以及多年的潛變與乾縮。","只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。","線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。"],"optionsEn":["Each segment's casting elevation is the final profile plus a camber that offsets every later deformation: the weight of later segments, prestress uplift, traveler removal, closure and continuity tendons, surfacing loads, and years of creep and shrinkage.","Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.","Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每一節塊的澆置高程等於完工縱斷面再加上預拱值，預拱抵銷之後所有會發生的變形：後續節塊自重、預力上拱、工作車移除、閉合與連續鋼腱、鋪面荷重，以及多年的潛變與乾縮。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each segment's casting elevation is the final profile plus a camber that offsets every later deformation: the weight of later segments, prestress uplift, traveler removal, closure and continuity tendons, surfacing loads, and years of creep and shrinkage. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b038-v13-22","title":"預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合：定量估算","titleEn":"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「閉合段與預拱線形」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Closure segment and camber” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：線性溫差造成曲率 κ = α·ΔT/h，懸臂端撓度 δ = κ·L²/2。α = 10×10⁻⁶ /°C、頂底溫差 ΔT = 10°C、平均梁深 h = 5 m、L = 75 m：κ = 2×10⁻⁵ 1/m，δ = 2×10⁻⁵×75²/2 ≈ 56 mm。中午測量若不修正，閉合高程可差數公分。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A linear temperature difference gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/h and tip deflection δ = κ·L²/2. With α = 10×10⁻⁶ /°C, a top-to-bottom difference ΔT = 10°C, average depth h = 5 m and L = 75 m, κ = 2×10⁻⁵ 1/m and δ = 2×10⁻⁵×75²/2 ≈ 56 mm. An uncorrected noon survey can therefore miss the closure level by several centimetres. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：閉合前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端的高程、相對水平位移與梁內溫度，選定溫差最小、兩端相對移動最少的時段；鎖定支撐安裝後確認兩端高差在允差內（例如 ±10 mm），閉合段澆置後追蹤試體強度，達標才張拉連續鋼腱並拆除臨時固結。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before closure, monitor tip levels, relative horizontal movement and internal girder temperature for 24 hours to choose the window with the smallest gradient and least relative movement; after installing the locking struts confirm the level difference is within tolerance, for example ±10 mm; after casting, track cylinder strength and only then stress continuity tendons and release temporary fixity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"線性溫差造成曲率 κ = α·ΔT/h，懸臂端撓度 δ = κ·L²/2。α = 10×10⁻⁶ /°C、頂底溫差 ΔT = 10°C、平均梁深 h = 5 m、L = 75 m：κ = 2×10⁻⁵ 1/m，δ = 2×10⁻⁵×75²/2 ≈ 56 mm。中午測量若不修正，閉合高程可差數公分。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A linear temperature difference gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/h and tip deflection δ = κ·L²/2. With α = 10×10⁻⁶ /°C, a top-to-bottom difference ΔT = 10°C, average depth h = 5 m and L = 75 m, κ = 2×10⁻⁵ 1/m and δ = 2×10⁻⁵×75²/2 ≈ 56 mm. An uncorrected noon survey can therefore miss the closure level by several centimetres. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure\", which statement holds?","options":["混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。","線性溫差造成曲率 κ = α·ΔT/h，懸臂端撓度 δ = κ·L²/2。","平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。"],"optionsEn":["Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.","A linear temperature difference gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/h and tip deflection δ = κ·L²/2.","A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"線性溫差造成曲率 κ = α·ΔT/h，懸臂端撓度 δ = κ·L²/2。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A linear temperature difference gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/h and tip deflection δ = κ·L²/2. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b038-v13-23","title":"預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「閉合段與預拱線形」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Closure segment and camber” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"閉合前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端的高程、相對水平位移與梁內溫度，選定溫差最小、兩端相對移動最少的時段；鎖定支撐安裝後確認兩端高差在允差內（例如 ±10 mm），閉合段澆置後追蹤試體強度，達標才張拉連續鋼腱並拆除臨時固結。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before closure, monitor tip levels, relative horizontal movement and internal girder temperature for 24 hours to choose the window with the smallest gradient and least relative movement; after installing the locking struts confirm the level difference is within tolerance, for example ±10 mm; after casting, track cylinder strength and only then stress continuity tendons and release temporary fixity. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：閉合程序書須包含鎖定支撐設計、溫度與時段條件、澆置與養護計畫、連續鋼腱張拉順序及臨時固結拆除順序，由設計與監造雙方簽認後才可執行。","observationEn":"Site practice: The closure procedure must include the locking-strut design, temperature and time-window conditions, casting and curing plan, continuity-stressing order and the sequence for releasing temporary fixity, and be signed by both designer and supervising engineer before execution.","failure":"注意干擾：若在白天高溫時鎖定兩懸臂端，夜間降溫收縮時閉合段新混凝土會被拉裂；預拱值低估潛變則讓跨中逐年下垂，形成明顯的「中跨凹陷」，影響行車舒適與排水。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Locking the tips during a hot afternoon lets night cooling pull the fresh closure concrete apart and crack it; underestimating creep in the camber makes the midspan sag year after year into a visible dip that harms ride quality and drainage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"閉合前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端的高程、相對水平位移與梁內溫度，選定溫差最小、兩端相對移動最少的時段；鎖定支撐安裝後確認兩端高差在允差內（例如 ±10 mm），閉合段澆置後追蹤試體強度，達標才張拉連續鋼腱並拆除臨時固結。","textEn":"Before closure, monitor tip levels, relative horizontal movement and internal girder temperature for 24 hours to choose the window with the smallest gradient and least relative movement; after installing the locking struts confirm the level difference is within tolerance, for example ±10 mm; after casting, track cylinder strength and only then stress continuity tendons and release temporary fixity.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"閉合程序書須包含鎖定支撐設計、溫度與時段條件、澆置與養護計畫、連續鋼腱張拉順序及臨時固結拆除順序，由設計與監造雙方簽認後才可執行。","textEn":"The closure procedure must include the locking-strut design, temperature and time-window conditions, casting and curing plan, continuity-stressing order and the sequence for releasing temporary fixity, and be signed by both designer and supervising engineer before execution.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。","閉合前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端的高程、相對水平位移與梁內溫度，選定溫差最小、兩端相對移動最少的時段。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.","Before closure, monitor tip levels, relative horizontal movement and internal girder temperature for 24 hours to choose the window with the smallest gradient and least relative movement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"閉合前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端的高程、相對水平位移與梁內溫度，選定溫差最小、兩端相對移動最少的時段；鎖定支撐安裝後確認兩端高差在允差內（例如 ±10 mm），閉合段澆置後追蹤試體強度，達標才張拉連續鋼腱並拆除臨時固結。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before closure, monitor tip levels, relative horizontal movement and internal girder temperature for 24 hours to choose the window with the smallest gradient and least relative movement; after installing the locking struts confirm the level difference is within tolerance, for example ±10 mm; after casting, track cylinder strength and only then stress continuity tendons and release temporary fixity. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b038-v13-24","title":"預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「閉合段與預拱線形」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Closure segment and camber” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若在白天高溫時鎖定兩懸臂端，夜間降溫收縮時閉合段新混凝土會被拉裂；預拱值低估潛變則讓跨中逐年下垂，形成明顯的「中跨凹陷」，影響行車舒適與排水。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Locking the tips during a hot afternoon lets night cooling pull the fresh closure concrete apart and crack it; underestimating creep in the camber makes the midspan sag year after year into a visible dip that harms ride quality and drainage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：閉合時先以鋼支撐或型鋼骨架把兩懸臂端鎖住，再於一天最低溫時澆置閉合段，使混凝土硬化時兩端不再相對移動。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: At closure, steel struts or a stiff skeleton first lock the two tips together, and the closure segment is cast at the day's lowest temperature so the tips no longer move relative to each other while the concrete hardens.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若在白天高溫時鎖定兩懸臂端，夜間降溫收縮時閉合段新混凝土會被拉裂；預拱值低估潛變則讓跨中逐年下垂，形成明顯的「中跨凹陷」，影響行車舒適與排水。","textEn":"Locking the tips during a hot afternoon lets night cooling pull the fresh closure concrete apart and crack it; underestimating creep in the camber makes the midspan sag year after year into a visible dip that harms ride quality and drainage.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「預拱、溫度效應與跨中閉合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Camber, thermal effects and midspan closure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若在白天高溫時鎖定兩懸臂端，夜間降溫收縮時閉合段新混凝土會被拉裂；預拱值低估潛變則讓跨中逐年下垂，形成明顯的「中跨凹陷」，影響行車舒適與排水。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。"],"optionsEn":["Locking the tips during a hot afternoon lets night cooling pull the fresh closure concrete apart and crack it.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若在白天高溫時鎖定兩懸臂端，夜間降溫收縮時閉合段新混凝土會被拉裂；預拱值低估潛變則讓跨中逐年下垂，形成明顯的「中跨凹陷」，影響行車舒適與排水。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Locking the tips during a hot afternoon lets night cooling pull the fresh closure concrete apart and crack it; underestimating creep in the camber makes the midspan sag year after year into a visible dip that harms ride quality and drainage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b038-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「線形測量與預拱回饋控制」與「摩擦損失與伸長量驗證」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Geometry survey and camber feedback\" and \"Friction losses and elongation checks\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b038-v13-25","title":"線形測量與預拱回饋控制：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Geometry survey and camber feedback: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「懸臂端測量控制點」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Survey points at cantilever tips” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"線形控制是一個回饋迴路：每一節塊在澆置前、澆置後、張拉後與工作車前移後都要量測端點高程，與預測撓度曲線比較，若偏差超出門檻，就修正後續節塊的澆置高程與模型參數（例如彈性模數、潛變係數、工作車勁度）。預鑄節塊的回饋則發生在預製場：每一節塊的匹配澆注幾何都要量測，因為一個微小的轉角誤差會沿懸臂放大。測量點需固定於節塊頂板並在全程保留。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「懸臂端測量控制點」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Geometry control is a feedback loop: each segment tip is surveyed before casting, after casting, after stressing and after the traveler moves, and compared with the predicted deflection curve; if the deviation exceeds a threshold, later casting elevations and model parameters such as elastic modulus, creep coefficient and traveler stiffness are revised. For precast segments the feedback happens in the casting yard: the match-cast geometry of every segment is surveyed, because a tiny angular error is amplified along the cantilever. Survey points are fixed in the top slab and kept for the whole job. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Survey points at cantilever tips” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：角度誤差沿懸臂放大：δ_tip = θ·L。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Angular error grows along the cantilever: δ_tip = θ·L.","failure":"常見誤解：「線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「懸臂端測量控制點」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Survey points at cantilever tips”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-25-k1","title":"線形測量與預拱回饋控制","titleEn":"Geometry survey and camber feedback","text":"線形控制是一個回饋迴路：每一節塊在澆置前、澆置後、張拉後與工作車前移後都要量測端點高程，與預測撓度曲線比較，若偏差超出門檻，就修正後續節塊的澆置高程與模型參數（例如彈性模數、潛變係數、工作車勁度）。預鑄節塊的回饋則發生在預製場：每一節塊的匹配澆注幾何都要量測，因為一個微小的轉角誤差會沿懸臂放大。","textEn":"Geometry control is a feedback loop: each segment tip is surveyed before casting, after casting, after stressing and after the traveler moves, and compared with the predicted deflection curve; if the deviation exceeds a threshold, later casting elevations and model parameters such as elastic modulus, creep coefficient and traveler stiffness are revised. For precast segments the feedback happens in the casting yard: the match-cast geometry of every segment is surveyed, because a tiny angular error is amplified along the cantilever.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「線形測量與預拱回饋控制」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Geometry survey and camber feedback\" is correct?","options":["線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。","線形控制是一個回饋迴路：每一節塊在澆置前、澆置後、張拉後與工作車前移後都要量測端點高程，與預測撓度曲線比較，若偏差超出門檻，就修正後續節塊的澆置高程與模型參數（例如彈性模數、潛變係數、工作車勁度）。","千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。"],"optionsEn":["Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure.","Geometry control is a feedback loop: each segment tip is surveyed before casting, after casting, after stressing and after the traveler moves, and compared with the predicted deflection curve.","If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"線形控制是一個回饋迴路：每一節塊在澆置前、澆置後、張拉後與工作車前移後都要量測端點高程，與預測撓度曲線比較，若偏差超出門檻，就修正後續節塊的澆置高程與模型參數（例如彈性模數、潛變係數、工作車勁度）。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Geometry control is a feedback loop: each segment tip is surveyed before casting, after casting, after stressing and after the traveler moves, and compared with the predicted deflection curve; if the deviation exceeds a threshold, later casting elevations and model parameters such as elastic modulus, creep coefficient and traveler stiffness are revised. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b038-v13-26","title":"線形測量與預拱回饋控制：定量估算","titleEn":"Geometry survey and camber feedback: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「懸臂端測量控制點」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Survey points at cantilever tips” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：角度誤差沿懸臂放大：δ_tip = θ·L。若柱頭段或某一匹配接縫的轉角誤差 θ = 0.0005 rad（每 4 m 節塊約 2 mm），在其後 69 m 懸臂端造成 δ = 0.0005×69 ≈ 34.5 mm 的高程誤差，已超過常見閉合允差。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Angular error grows along the cantilever: δ_tip = θ·L. A rotation error θ = 0.0005 rad at the pier table or at one match-cast joint (about 2 mm over a 4 m segment) produces δ = 0.0005×69 ≈ 34.5 mm at a tip 69 m away, more than a typical closure tolerance. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以精密水準儀與全站儀在固定時段（清晨）量測，每次記錄溫度並與前次比對；建立「預測—實測—修正」表，每一節塊的偏差與修正量由線形控制工程師簽名；預製場以控制線與測量塔每節塊量測匹配幾何，並計算累積轉角誤差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Survey with a precise level and total station at a fixed early-morning time, logging temperature and comparing with the previous set; keep a predicted–measured–corrected table in which the geometry-control engineer signs each segment's deviation and correction; in the casting yard, measure match-cast geometry for every segment from control lines and survey towers and compute the cumulative angular error.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"角度誤差沿懸臂放大：δ_tip = θ·L。若柱頭段或某一匹配接縫的轉角誤差 θ = 0.0005 rad（每 4 m 節塊約 2 mm），在其後 69 m 懸臂端造成 δ = 0.0005×69 ≈ 34.5 mm 的高程誤差，已超過常見閉合允差。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Angular error grows along the cantilever: δ_tip = θ·L. A rotation error θ = 0.0005 rad at the pier table or at one match-cast joint (about 2 mm over a 4 m segment) produces δ = 0.0005×69 ≈ 34.5 mm at a tip 69 m away, more than a typical closure tolerance. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「線形測量與預拱回饋控制」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Geometry survey and camber feedback\", which statement holds?","options":["預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。","只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。","角度誤差沿懸臂放大：δ_tip = θ·L。"],"optionsEn":["The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection.","If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier.","Angular error grows along the cantilever: δ_tip = θ·L."],"answer":2,"explanation":"角度誤差沿懸臂放大：δ_tip = θ·L。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Angular error grows along the cantilever: δ_tip = θ·L. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b038-v13-27","title":"線形測量與預拱回饋控制：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Geometry survey and camber feedback: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「懸臂端測量控制點」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Survey points at cantilever tips” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以精密水準儀與全站儀在固定時段（清晨）量測，每次記錄溫度並與前次比對；建立「預測—實測—修正」表，每一節塊的偏差與修正量由線形控制工程師簽名；預製場以控制線與測量塔每節塊量測匹配幾何，並計算累積轉角誤差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Survey with a precise level and total station at a fixed early-morning time, logging temperature and comparing with the previous set; keep a predicted–measured–corrected table in which the geometry-control engineer signs each segment's deviation and correction; in the casting yard, measure match-cast geometry for every segment from control lines and survey towers and compute the cumulative angular error. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：指定專職線形控制工程師，並在每節塊澆置前發出經簽認的模板高程單；預測模型的參數每完成數個節塊就以實測值重新校正，修正紀錄納入竣工資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: Appoint a dedicated geometry-control engineer who issues a signed form-level sheet before every segment is cast; recalibrate the prediction model with measured data every few segments and include the correction history in the as-built records.","failure":"注意干擾：測量點被覆蓋或移位而未發現，後續節塊依錯誤基準修正，閉合時兩端高差過大，只能以額外的頂升、配重或閉合段變形吸收，造成殘餘應力與線形折角。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A survey point that is buried or disturbed without anyone noticing makes later segments correct against a false datum, so the tips miss each other at closure and the gap must be absorbed by jacking, ballast or a distorted closure segment, leaving residual stress and a kink in the profile. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以精密水準儀與全站儀在固定時段（清晨）量測，每次記錄溫度並與前次比對；建立「預測—實測—修正」表，每一節塊的偏差與修正量由線形控制工程師簽名；預製場以控制線與測量塔每節塊量測匹配幾何，並計算累積轉角誤差。","textEn":"Survey with a precise level and total station at a fixed early-morning time, logging temperature and comparing with the previous set; keep a predicted–measured–corrected table in which the geometry-control engineer signs each segment's deviation and correction; in the casting yard, measure match-cast geometry for every segment from control lines and survey towers and compute the cumulative angular error.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"指定專職線形控制工程師，並在每節塊澆置前發出經簽認的模板高程單；預測模型的參數每完成數個節塊就以實測值重新校正，修正紀錄納入竣工資料。","textEn":"Appoint a dedicated geometry-control engineer who issues a signed form-level sheet before every segment is cast; recalibrate the prediction model with measured data every few segments and include the correction history in the as-built records.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「線形測量與預拱回饋控制」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Geometry survey and camber feedback\"?","options":["以精密水準儀與全站儀在固定時段（清晨）量測，每次記錄溫度並與前次比對。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。"],"optionsEn":["Survey with a precise level and total station at a fixed early-morning time, logging temperature and comparing with the previous set.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以精密水準儀與全站儀在固定時段（清晨）量測，每次記錄溫度並與前次比對；建立「預測—實測—修正」表，每一節塊的偏差與修正量由線形控制工程師簽名；預製場以控制線與測量塔每節塊量測匹配幾何，並計算累積轉角誤差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Survey with a precise level and total station at a fixed early-morning time, logging temperature and comparing with the previous set; keep a predicted–measured–corrected table in which the geometry-control engineer signs each segment's deviation and correction; in the casting yard, measure match-cast geometry for every segment from control lines and survey towers and compute the cumulative angular error. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b038-v13-28","title":"線形測量與預拱回饋控制：失效診斷","titleEn":"Geometry survey and camber feedback: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「懸臂端測量控制點」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Survey points at cantilever tips” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"測量點被覆蓋或移位而未發現，後續節塊依錯誤基準修正，閉合時兩端高差過大，只能以額外的頂升、配重或閉合段變形吸收，造成殘餘應力與線形折角。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A survey point that is buried or disturbed without anyone noticing makes later segments correct against a false datum, so the tips miss each other at closure and the gap must be absorbed by jacking, ballast or a distorted closure segment, leaving residual stress and a kink in the profile. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：測量點需固定於節塊頂板並在全程保留。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Survey points are fixed in the top slab and kept for the whole job.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"測量點被覆蓋或移位而未發現，後續節塊依錯誤基準修正，閉合時兩端高差過大，只能以額外的頂升、配重或閉合段變形吸收，造成殘餘應力與線形折角。","textEn":"A survey point that is buried or disturbed without anyone noticing makes later segments correct against a false datum, so the tips miss each other at closure and the gap must be absorbed by jacking, ballast or a distorted closure segment, leaving residual stress and a kink in the profile.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「線形測量與預拱回饋控制」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Geometry survey and camber feedback\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","測量點被覆蓋或移位而未發現，後續節塊依錯誤基準修正，閉合時兩端高差過大，只能以額外的頂升、配重或閉合段變形吸收，造成殘餘應力與線形折角。","千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A survey point that is buried or disturbed without anyone noticing makes later segments correct against a false datum, so the tips miss each other at closure and the gap must be absorbed by jacking, ballast or a distorted closure segment, leaving residual stress and a kink in the profile.","If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"測量點被覆蓋或移位而未發現，後續節塊依錯誤基準修正，閉合時兩端高差過大，只能以額外的頂升、配重或閉合段變形吸收，造成殘餘應力與線形折角。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A survey point that is buried or disturbed without anyone noticing makes later segments correct against a false datum, so the tips miss each other at closure and the gap must be absorbed by jacking, ballast or a distorted closure segment, leaving residual stress and a kink in the profile. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b038-v13-29","title":"摩擦損失與伸長量驗證：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Friction losses and elongation checks: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「張拉伸長量紀錄」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Stressing elongation records” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"鋼腱在孔道內張拉時，因曲率與孔道擺動產生摩擦，力量沿長度遞減；千斤頂讀到的是張拉端力，而真正留在箱梁中的是沿程平均力。工地無法直接量鋼腱內力，所以以伸長量作為獨立的第二個量測：若實測伸長量明顯小於計算值，代表摩擦比假設大或孔道受阻；若明顯偏大，則可能有滑絲或量測錯誤。兩者都必須在灌漿前查明，因為灌漿後就無法再處理。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「張拉伸長量紀錄」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When a tendon is stressed in its duct, curvature and wobble cause friction so force decreases along the length; the jack reads the force at the stressing end, while what the girder keeps is the average force along the tendon. The site cannot measure tendon force directly, so elongation is the independent second measurement: an elongation well below calculation means more friction than assumed or a blocked duct, one well above may mean strand slip or a measuring error. Either must be resolved before grouting, because afterwards nothing can be done. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Stressing elongation records” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx).","failure":"常見誤解：「千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「張拉伸長量紀錄」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Stressing elongation records”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-29-k1","title":"摩擦損失與伸長量驗證","titleEn":"Friction losses and elongation checks","text":"鋼腱在孔道內張拉時，因曲率與孔道擺動產生摩擦，力量沿長度遞減；千斤頂讀到的是張拉端力，而真正留在箱梁中的是沿程平均力。工地無法直接量鋼腱內力，所以以伸長量作為獨立的第二個量測：若實測伸長量明顯小於計算值，代表摩擦比假設大或孔道受阻；若明顯偏大，則可能有滑絲或量測錯誤。","textEn":"When a tendon is stressed in its duct, curvature and wobble cause friction so force decreases along the length; the jack reads the force at the stressing end, while what the girder keeps is the average force along the tendon. The site cannot measure tendon force directly, so elongation is the independent second measurement: an elongation well below calculation means more friction than assumed or a blocked duct, one well above may mean strand slip or a measuring error.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「摩擦損失與伸長量驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Friction losses and elongation checks\" is correct?","options":["千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。","混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。","鋼腱在孔道內張拉時，因曲率與孔道擺動產生摩擦，力量沿長度遞減；千斤頂讀到的是張拉端力，而真正留在箱梁中的是沿程平均力。"],"optionsEn":["If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress.","Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.","When a tendon is stressed in its duct, curvature and wobble cause friction so force decreases along the length."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鋼腱在孔道內張拉時，因曲率與孔道擺動產生摩擦，力量沿長度遞減；千斤頂讀到的是張拉端力，而真正留在箱梁中的是沿程平均力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When a tendon is stressed in its duct, curvature and wobble cause friction so force decreases along the length; the jack reads the force at the stressing end, while what the girder keeps is the average force along the tendon. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b038-v13-30","title":"摩擦損失與伸長量驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Friction losses and elongation checks: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「張拉伸長量紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Stressing elongation records” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx)。P₀ = 3,711 kN、μ = 0.20、轉角 α = 0.35 rad、k = 0.0007 /m、長度 60 m：錨固端 P = 3,711×e^−0.112 ≈ 3,318 kN；平均力係數 (1 − e^−0.112)/0.112 ≈ 0.947，伸長量 ΔL = 0.947×3,711×60,000/(2,660×195) ≈ 406 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx). With P₀ = 3,711 kN, μ = 0.20, angle α = 0.35 rad, k = 0.0007 /m and length 60 m, the dead-end force is P = 3,711×e^−0.112 ≈ 3,318 kN; the average-force factor (1 − e^−0.112)/0.112 ≈ 0.947 gives elongation ΔL = 0.947×3,711×60,000/(2,660×195) ≈ 406 mm. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：千斤頂與壓力錶須有效校正並成套使用；張拉時分級記錄壓力與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段與錨具回縮，與計算伸長量比較，偏差超出規範允差（常見為 ±5% 至 ±7%）即停止並通報設計單位；初期數束可做摩擦試驗反算 μ 與 k。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Jacks and gauges must be calibrated and used as matched sets; record pressure and elongation in increments, correct for initial slack and anchor set, and compare with the calculated elongation, stopping and notifying the designer if the deviation exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%; friction tests on the first tendons can back-calculate μ and k.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx)。P₀ = 3,711 kN、μ = 0.20、轉角 α = 0.35 rad、k = 0.0007 /m、長度 60 m：錨固端 P = 3,711×e^−0.112 ≈ 3,318 kN；平均力係數 (1 − e^−0.112)/0.112 ≈ 0.947，伸長量 ΔL = 0.947×3,711×60,000/(2,660×195) ≈ 406 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx). With P₀ = 3,711 kN, μ = 0.20, angle α = 0.35 rad, k = 0.0007 /m and length 60 m, the dead-end force is P = 3,711×e^−0.112 ≈ 3,318 kN; the average-force factor (1 − e^−0.112)/0.112 ≈ 0.947 gives elongation ΔL = 0.947×3,711×60,000/(2,660×195) ≈ 406 mm. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「摩擦損失與伸長量驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Friction losses and elongation checks\", which statement holds?","options":["P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx)。","平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。","懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。"],"optionsEn":["P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx).","A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough.","Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"P(x) = P₀·e^−(μα + kx). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b038-v13-31","title":"摩擦損失與伸長量驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Friction losses and elongation checks: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「張拉伸長量紀錄」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Stressing elongation records” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"千斤頂與壓力錶須有效校正並成套使用；張拉時分級記錄壓力與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段與錨具回縮，與計算伸長量比較，偏差超出規範允差（常見為 ±5% 至 ±7%）即停止並通報設計單位；初期數束可做摩擦試驗反算 μ 與 k。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Jacks and gauges must be calibrated and used as matched sets; record pressure and elongation in increments, correct for initial slack and anchor set, and compare with the calculated elongation, stopping and notifying the designer if the deviation exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%; friction tests on the first tendons can back-calculate μ and k. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：張拉紀錄表需包含千斤頂編號、校正日期、各級壓力與伸長量、錨具回縮量與計算值，由張拉技術人員與監造雙簽；任何超出允差的鋼腱在灌漿前必須有書面處置決定。","observationEn":"Site practice: The stressing record must include jack number, calibration date, pressure and elongation at each step, anchor set and the calculated value, signed by both the stressing technician and the supervising engineer; any tendon outside tolerance needs a written decision before grouting.","failure":"注意干擾：孔道在澆置時被壓扁或漏漿堵塞，鋼腱伸長量偏小卻被當作量測誤差放行，結果有效預力不足，懸臂端下撓超出預測，頂板在營運期開裂。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A duct crushed or blocked by grout leakage during casting gives short elongation that is waved through as a measuring error; the effective prestress is then deficient, the tip deflects more than predicted, and the top slab cracks in service. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"千斤頂與壓力錶須有效校正並成套使用；張拉時分級記錄壓力與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段與錨具回縮，與計算伸長量比較，偏差超出規範允差（常見為 ±5% 至 ±7%）即停止並通報設計單位；初期數束可做摩擦試驗反算 μ 與 k。","textEn":"Jacks and gauges must be calibrated and used as matched sets; record pressure and elongation in increments, correct for initial slack and anchor set, and compare with the calculated elongation, stopping and notifying the designer if the deviation exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%; friction tests on the first tendons can back-calculate μ and k.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"張拉紀錄表需包含千斤頂編號、校正日期、各級壓力與伸長量、錨具回縮量與計算值，由張拉技術人員與監造雙簽；任何超出允差的鋼腱在灌漿前必須有書面處置決定。","textEn":"The stressing record must include jack number, calibration date, pressure and elongation at each step, anchor set and the calculated value, signed by both the stressing technician and the supervising engineer; any tendon outside tolerance needs a written decision before grouting.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「摩擦損失與伸長量驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Friction losses and elongation checks\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","千斤頂與壓力錶須有效校正並成套使用。","掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Jacks and gauges must be calibrated and used as matched sets.","A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry."],"answer":1,"explanation":"千斤頂與壓力錶須有效校正並成套使用；張拉時分級記錄壓力與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段與錨具回縮，與計算伸長量比較，偏差超出規範允差（常見為 ±5% 至 ±7%）即停止並通報設計單位；初期數束可做摩擦試驗反算 μ 與 k。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Jacks and gauges must be calibrated and used as matched sets; record pressure and elongation in increments, correct for initial slack and anchor set, and compare with the calculated elongation, stopping and notifying the designer if the deviation exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%; friction tests on the first tendons can back-calculate μ and k. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b038-v13-32","title":"摩擦損失與伸長量驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Friction losses and elongation checks: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「張拉伸長量紀錄」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stressing elongation records” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"孔道在澆置時被壓扁或漏漿堵塞，鋼腱伸長量偏小卻被當作量測誤差放行，結果有效預力不足，懸臂端下撓超出預測，頂板在營運期開裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A duct crushed or blocked by grout leakage during casting gives short elongation that is waved through as a measuring error; the effective prestress is then deficient, the tip deflects more than predicted, and the top slab cracks in service. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：兩者都必須在灌漿前查明，因為灌漿後就無法再處理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Either must be resolved before grouting, because afterwards nothing can be done.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「千斤頂壓力達到設計值，就代表鋼腱整段都有設計預力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the jack reaches the design pressure, the whole tendon carries the design prestress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"孔道在澆置時被壓扁或漏漿堵塞，鋼腱伸長量偏小卻被當作量測誤差放行，結果有效預力不足，懸臂端下撓超出預測，頂板在營運期開裂。","textEn":"A duct crushed or blocked by grout leakage during casting gives short elongation that is waved through as a measuring error; the effective prestress is then deficient, the tip deflects more than predicted, and the top slab cracks in service.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「摩擦損失與伸長量驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Friction losses and elongation checks\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。","孔道在澆置時被壓扁或漏漿堵塞，鋼腱伸長量偏小卻被當作量測誤差放行，結果有效預力不足，懸臂端下撓超出預測，頂板在營運期開裂。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.","A duct crushed or blocked by grout leakage during casting gives short elongation that is waved through as a measuring error."],"answer":2,"explanation":"孔道在澆置時被壓扁或漏漿堵塞，鋼腱伸長量偏小卻被當作量測誤差放行，結果有效預力不足，懸臂端下撓超出預測，頂板在營運期開裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A duct crushed or blocked by grout leakage during casting gives short elongation that is waved through as a measuring error; the effective prestress is then deficient, the tip deflects more than predicted, and the top slab cracks in service. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b038-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「潛變、預力損失與長期撓度」與「預力檢查、補強預留與交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection\" and \"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b038-v13-33","title":"潛變、預力損失與長期撓度：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「跨中長期下垂」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Long-term midspan sag” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"平衡懸臂橋在閉合前是靜定懸臂，閉合後成為連續梁，混凝土潛變會讓結構逐漸往「一次整體澆築」的內力狀態重分配，跨中正彎矩增加。同時鋼腱鬆弛、混凝土乾縮與潛變造成預力損失，使跨中持續下垂。長跨箱梁對這些參數極為敏感：1977 年完工的 Koror–Babeldaob 橋主跨約 241 m，跨中設鉸，約 16 年後懸臂端下撓超過約 1.2 m；1996 年 7 月完成封閉中鉸並加設連續體外預力的補強，同年 9 月倒塌，鑑定調查認為頂板分層剝離觸發破壞，成為長期撓度與補強評估的經典教訓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「跨中長期下垂」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Before closure a balanced-cantilever bridge is a statically determinate cantilever; after closure it is continuous, and creep gradually redistributes moments towards the state of a girder cast in one piece, increasing midspan sagging moment. Strand relaxation, shrinkage and creep also reduce prestress, so the midspan keeps sagging. Long-span boxes are very sensitive to these parameters: the Koror–Babeldaob Bridge, completed in 1977 with a main span of about 241 m and a midspan hinge, had cantilever tips that deflected more than about 1.2 m after some 16 years; a retrofit finished in July 1996 closed the hinge and added continuous external tendons, and the bridge collapsed that September, with the forensic investigation pointing to delamination of the top flange as the trigger, a classic lesson in long-term deflection and retrofit assessment. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Long-term midspan sag” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：長期撓度 δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Long-term deflection δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ).","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「跨中長期下垂」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Long-term midspan sag”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-33-k1","title":"潛變、預力損失與長期撓度","titleEn":"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection","text":"平衡懸臂橋在閉合前是靜定懸臂，閉合後成為連續梁，混凝土潛變會讓結構逐漸往「一次整體澆築」的內力狀態重分配，跨中正彎矩增加。同時鋼腱鬆弛、混凝土乾縮與潛變造成預力損失，使跨中持續下垂。","textEn":"Before closure a balanced-cantilever bridge is a statically determinate cantilever; after closure it is continuous, and creep gradually redistributes moments towards the state of a girder cast in one piece, increasing midspan sagging moment. Strand relaxation, shrinkage and creep also reduce prestress, so the midspan keeps sagging.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「潛變、預力損失與長期撓度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection\" is correct?","options":["平衡懸臂橋在閉合前是靜定懸臂，閉合後成為連續梁，混凝土潛變會讓結構逐漸往「一次整體澆築」的內力狀態重分配，跨中正彎矩增加。","混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。","預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。"],"optionsEn":["Before closure a balanced-cantilever bridge is a statically determinate cantilever.","Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.","The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"平衡懸臂橋在閉合前是靜定懸臂，閉合後成為連續梁，混凝土潛變會讓結構逐漸往「一次整體澆築」的內力狀態重分配，跨中正彎矩增加。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Before closure a balanced-cantilever bridge is a statically determinate cantilever; after closure it is continuous, and creep gradually redistributes moments towards the state of a girder cast in one piece, increasing midspan sagging moment. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b038-v13-34","title":"潛變、預力損失與長期撓度：定量估算","titleEn":"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「跨中長期下垂」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Long-term midspan sag” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：長期撓度 δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ)。跨中彈性撓度 δ_el = 60 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時 δ_∞ = 60×3.0 = 180 mm；若實際 φ = 2.5，δ_∞ = 60×3.5 = 210 mm，多出 30 mm，預拱若以 φ = 2.0 設定就會殘留下垂。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Long-term deflection δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ). With an elastic midspan deflection δ_el = 60 mm and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, δ_∞ = 60×3.0 = 180 mm; if the real φ is 2.5, δ_∞ = 60×3.5 = 210 mm, 30 mm more, so a camber set for φ = 2.0 leaves a residual sag. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：設計階段以至少兩種潛變乾縮模型（例如 fib Model Code 與 ACI 209 或 B3/B4）做敏感度分析，評估長期撓度上下限；完工後建立跨中與四分點高程的固定測量點，定期在相同溫度條件下量測，與預測曲線比較，偏離趨勢持續擴大時啟動結構評估。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At design stage, run a sensitivity study with at least two creep–shrinkage models, for example fib Model Code and ACI 209 or B3/B4, to bound long-term deflection; after completion set permanent level points at midspan and quarter points and survey them periodically under similar temperatures, triggering a structural assessment if the deviation from prediction keeps growing.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"長期撓度 δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ)。跨中彈性撓度 δ_el = 60 mm、潛變係數 φ = 2.0 時 δ_∞ = 60×3.0 = 180 mm；若實際 φ = 2.5，δ_∞ = 60×3.5 = 210 mm，多出 30 mm，預拱若以 φ = 2.0 設定就會殘留下垂。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Long-term deflection δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ). With an elastic midspan deflection δ_el = 60 mm and creep coefficient φ = 2.0, δ_∞ = 60×3.0 = 180 mm; if the real φ is 2.5, δ_∞ = 60×3.5 = 210 mm, 30 mm more, so a camber set for φ = 2.0 leaves a residual sag. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「潛變、預力損失與長期撓度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection\", which statement holds?","options":["只要兩側節塊數量相同，墩頂就不會有不平衡彎矩。","長期撓度 δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ)。","預鑄節塊的環氧接縫就像膠水，主要靠黏著力承受剪力。"],"optionsEn":["If both sides have the same number of segments, there is no unbalanced moment at the pier.","Long-term deflection δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ).","The epoxy in precast segment joints acts like glue and carries shear mainly by adhesion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"長期撓度 δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Long-term deflection δ_∞ ≈ δ_el·(1 + φ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b038-v13-35","title":"潛變、預力損失與長期撓度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨中長期下垂」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Long-term midspan sag” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"設計階段以至少兩種潛變乾縮模型（例如 fib Model Code 與 ACI 209 或 B3/B4）做敏感度分析，評估長期撓度上下限；完工後建立跨中與四分點高程的固定測量點，定期在相同溫度條件下量測，與預測曲線比較，偏離趨勢持續擴大時啟動結構評估。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At design stage, run a sensitivity study with at least two creep–shrinkage models, for example fib Model Code and ACI 209 or B3/B4, to bound long-term deflection; after completion set permanent level points at midspan and quarter points and survey them periodically under similar temperatures, triggering a structural assessment if the deviation from prediction keeps growing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：竣工資料必須保存施工期線形紀錄、預拱值與長期撓度預測曲線；任何長期下垂或補強工程前，先由獨立的結構工程師以實測資料重新評估，並將評估結論列為施工許可的前提。","observationEn":"Site practice: As-built records must keep the construction geometry log, camber values and the predicted long-term deflection curve; before any sag remedy or retrofit, an independent structural engineer re-assesses the bridge with measured data, and that assessment is a precondition for the works permit.","failure":"注意干擾：只採用單一短期試驗得到的潛變係數，或忽略預力鬆弛與乾縮的長期損失，跨中下垂會在十多年內持續擴大；若補強時未充分理解既有預力與潛變狀態，新增荷重或改變結構系統可能觸發突然破壞。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using a single short-term creep coefficient, or ignoring long-term relaxation and shrinkage losses, lets midspan sag grow for more than a decade; a retrofit made without understanding the existing prestress and creep state can add load or change the structural system and trigger sudden failure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"設計階段以至少兩種潛變乾縮模型（例如 fib Model Code 與 ACI 209 或 B3/B4）做敏感度分析，評估長期撓度上下限；完工後建立跨中與四分點高程的固定測量點，定期在相同溫度條件下量測，與預測曲線比較，偏離趨勢持續擴大時啟動結構評估。","textEn":"At design stage, run a sensitivity study with at least two creep–shrinkage models, for example fib Model Code and ACI 209 or B3/B4, to bound long-term deflection; after completion set permanent level points at midspan and quarter points and survey them periodically under similar temperatures, triggering a structural assessment if the deviation from prediction keeps growing.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"竣工資料必須保存施工期線形紀錄、預拱值與長期撓度預測曲線；任何長期下垂或補強工程前，先由獨立的結構工程師以實測資料重新評估，並將評估結論列為施工許可的前提。","textEn":"As-built records must keep the construction geometry log, camber values and the predicted long-term deflection curve; before any sag remedy or retrofit, an independent structural engineer re-assesses the bridge with measured data, and that assessment is a precondition for the works permit.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「潛變、預力損失與長期撓度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","只要兩懸臂端在閉合當天高程相同，橋梁線形就已經完成。","設計階段以至少兩種潛變乾縮模型（例如 fib Model Code 與 ACI 209 或 B3/B4）做敏感度分析，評估長期撓度上下限。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Once the two tips are at the same level on closure day, the bridge geometry is finished.","At design stage, run a sensitivity study with at least two creep–shrinkage models, for example fib Model Code and ACI 209 or B3/B4, to bound long-term deflection."],"answer":2,"explanation":"設計階段以至少兩種潛變乾縮模型（例如 fib Model Code 與 ACI 209 或 B3/B4）做敏感度分析，評估長期撓度上下限；完工後建立跨中與四分點高程的固定測量點，定期在相同溫度條件下量測，與預測曲線比較，偏離趨勢持續擴大時啟動結構評估。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"At design stage, run a sensitivity study with at least two creep–shrinkage models, for example fib Model Code and ACI 209 or B3/B4, to bound long-term deflection; after completion set permanent level points at midspan and quarter points and survey them periodically under similar temperatures, triggering a structural assessment if the deviation from prediction keeps growing. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b038-v13-36","title":"潛變、預力損失與長期撓度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「跨中長期下垂」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Long-term midspan sag” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只採用單一短期試驗得到的潛變係數，或忽略預力鬆弛與乾縮的長期損失，跨中下垂會在十多年內持續擴大；若補強時未充分理解既有預力與潛變狀態，新增荷重或改變結構系統可能觸發突然破壞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using a single short-term creep coefficient, or ignoring long-term relaxation and shrinkage losses, lets midspan sag grow for more than a decade; a retrofit made without understanding the existing prestress and creep state can add load or change the structural system and trigger sudden failure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：長跨箱梁對這些參數極為敏感：1977 年完工的 Koror–Babeldaob 橋主跨約 241 m，跨中設鉸，約 16 年後懸臂端下撓超過約 1.2 m；1996 年 7 月完成封閉中鉸並加設連續體外預力的補強，同年 9 月倒塌，鑑定調查認為頂板分層剝離觸發破壞，成為長期撓度與補強評估的經典教訓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Long-span boxes are very sensitive to these parameters: the Koror–Babeldaob Bridge, completed in 1977 with a main span of about 241 m and a midspan hinge, had cantilever tips that deflected more than about 1.2 m after some 16 years; a retrofit finished in July 1996 closed the hinge and added continuous external tendons, and the bridge collapsed that September, with the forensic investigation pointing to delamination of the top flange as the trigger, a classic lesson in long-term deflection and retrofit assessment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土潛變幾年內就結束，之後撓度不再增加。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Concrete creep ends within a few years, after which deflection stops increasing.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只採用單一短期試驗得到的潛變係數，或忽略預力鬆弛與乾縮的長期損失，跨中下垂會在十多年內持續擴大；若補強時未充分理解既有預力與潛變狀態，新增荷重或改變結構系統可能觸發突然破壞。","textEn":"Using a single short-term creep coefficient, or ignoring long-term relaxation and shrinkage losses, lets midspan sag grow for more than a decade; a retrofit made without understanding the existing prestress and creep state can add load or change the structural system and trigger sudden failure.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「潛變、預力損失與長期撓度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Creep, prestress loss and long-term deflection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只採用單一短期試驗得到的潛變係數，或忽略預力鬆弛與乾縮的長期損失，跨中下垂會在十多年內持續擴大。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。"],"optionsEn":["Using a single short-term creep coefficient, or ignoring long-term relaxation and shrinkage losses, lets midspan sag grow for more than a decade.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只採用單一短期試驗得到的潛變係數，或忽略預力鬆弛與乾縮的長期損失，跨中下垂會在十多年內持續擴大；若補強時未充分理解既有預力與潛變狀態，新增荷重或改變結構系統可能觸發突然破壞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a single short-term creep coefficient, or ignoring long-term relaxation and shrinkage losses, lets midspan sag grow for more than a decade; a retrofit made without understanding the existing prestress and creep state can add load or change the structural system and trigger sudden failure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b038-v13-37","title":"預力檢查、補強預留與交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「備用預力孔道」如何影響橋梁節塊平衡懸臂施工的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Spare post-tensioning ducts” governs force, deformation or durability in “Balanced-cantilever segmental bridge construction”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"平衡懸臂橋的長期性能取決於預力系統是否完整：體內鋼腱靠灌漿保護，難以直接檢查，因此要靠箱內檢查、裂縫圖、撓度紀錄與非破壞檢測（例如透地雷達或磁漏檢測）間接判斷。現代規範要求預留備用孔道、錨碇與轉向塊，讓日後可以加裝體外鋼腱補償預力損失或增加載重能力；箱梁內部也需有照明、通風、排水與通行門，使檢查人員能沿全長走動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「備用預力孔道」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The long-term performance of a balanced-cantilever bridge depends on the integrity of its prestress: internal tendons are protected by grout and hard to inspect, so their condition is judged indirectly through inspections inside the box, crack maps, deflection records and non-destructive methods such as ground-penetrating radar or magnetic flux leakage. Modern provisions call for spare ducts, anchorages and deviators so that external tendons can later be added to make up for losses or increase capacity, and the box interior needs lighting, ventilation, drainage and access doors so inspectors can walk its full length. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Spare post-tensioning ducts” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若預留能力取正負彎矩區預力的 10%：墩頂懸臂預力 127,500 kN 的 10% 為 12,750 kN，以每束 3,200 kN 計需 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 束，即在墩頂兩側各預留 2 組錨碇與孔道。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If the provision is 10% of the negative- and positive-moment prestress, 10% of the 127,500 kN pier cantilever prestress is 12,750 kN; at 3,200 kN per tendon that is 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 tendons, i.e. two spare anchorages and ducts on each side of the pier.","failure":"常見誤解：「預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「備用預力孔道」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Spare post-tensioning ducts”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-37-k1","title":"預力檢查、補強預留與交接","titleEn":"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover","text":"平衡懸臂橋的長期性能取決於預力系統是否完整：體內鋼腱靠灌漿保護，難以直接檢查，因此要靠箱內檢查、裂縫圖、撓度紀錄與非破壞檢測（例如透地雷達或磁漏檢測）間接判斷。現代規範要求預留備用孔道、錨碇與轉向塊，讓日後可以加裝體外鋼腱補償預力損失或增加載重能力；箱梁內部也需有照明、通風、排水與通行門，使檢查人員能沿全長走動。","textEn":"The long-term performance of a balanced-cantilever bridge depends on the integrity of its prestress: internal tendons are protected by grout and hard to inspect, so their condition is judged indirectly through inspections inside the box, crack maps, deflection records and non-destructive methods such as ground-penetrating radar or magnetic flux leakage. Modern provisions call for spare ducts, anchorages and deviators so that external tendons can later be added to make up for losses or increase capacity, and the box interior needs lighting, ventilation, drainage and access doors so inspectors can walk its full length.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「預力檢查、補強預留與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover\" is correct?","options":["預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。","平衡懸臂橋的長期性能取決於預力系統是否完整：體內鋼腱靠灌漿保護，難以直接檢查，因此要靠箱內檢查、裂縫圖、撓度紀錄與非破壞檢測（例如透地雷達或磁漏檢測）間接判斷。","平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。"],"optionsEn":["The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection.","The long-term performance of a balanced-cantilever bridge depends on the integrity of its prestress: internal tendons are protected by grout and hard to inspect, so their condition is judged indirectly through inspections inside the box, crack maps, deflection records and non-destructive methods such as ground-penetrating radar or magnetic flux leakage.","A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"平衡懸臂橋的長期性能取決於預力系統是否完整：體內鋼腱靠灌漿保護，難以直接檢查，因此要靠箱內檢查、裂縫圖、撓度紀錄與非破壞檢測（例如透地雷達或磁漏檢測）間接判斷。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The long-term performance of a balanced-cantilever bridge depends on the integrity of its prestress: internal tendons are protected by grout and hard to inspect, so their condition is judged indirectly through inspections inside the box, crack maps, deflection records and non-destructive methods such as ground-penetrating radar or magnetic flux leakage. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b038-v13-38","title":"預力檢查、補強預留與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「備用預力孔道」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Spare post-tensioning ducts” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若預留能力取正負彎矩區預力的 10%：墩頂懸臂預力 127,500 kN 的 10% 為 12,750 kN，以每束 3,200 kN 計需 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 束，即在墩頂兩側各預留 2 組錨碇與孔道。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If the provision is 10% of the negative- and positive-moment prestress, 10% of the 127,500 kN pier cantilever prestress is 12,750 kN; at 3,200 kN per tendon that is 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 tendons, i.e. two spare anchorages and ducts on each side of the pier. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：交接前做一次完整基準檢查：箱內裂縫圖與寬度、錨頭保護蓋狀態、灌漿孔與排氣孔封閉、跨中與墩頂高程、伸縮縫間隙，所有結果附照片與座標存入養護資料庫；之後每次定期檢查都與此基準比較，裂縫寬度或撓度增量超過門檻即啟動詳細評估。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before handover, carry out a full baseline inspection: crack maps and widths inside the box, anchor cap condition, sealing of grout and vent ports, midspan and pier levels, and joint gaps, with photographs and coordinates stored in the maintenance database; compare every later routine inspection with this baseline and trigger a detailed assessment if crack widths or deflection increments exceed thresholds.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若預留能力取正負彎矩區預力的 10%：墩頂懸臂預力 127,500 kN 的 10% 為 12,750 kN，以每束 3,200 kN 計需 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 束，即在墩頂兩側各預留 2 組錨碇與孔道。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"If the provision is 10% of the negative- and positive-moment prestress, 10% of the 127,500 kN pier cantilever prestress is 12,750 kN; at 3,200 kN per tendon that is 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 tendons, i.e. two spare anchorages and ducts on each side of the pier. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「預力檢查、補強預留與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["懸臂鋼腱只在施工期有用，閉合後就可以不計。","掛籃只是模板，重量與變形不會影響橋梁線形。","若預留能力取正負彎矩區預力的 10%：墩頂懸臂預力 127,500 kN 的 10% 為 12,750 kN，以每束 3,200 kN 計需 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 束，即在墩頂兩側各預留 2 組錨碇與孔道。"],"optionsEn":["Cantilever tendons only matter during construction and can be ignored after closure.","A form traveler is just formwork, so its weight and deflection do not affect the bridge geometry.","If the provision is 10% of the negative- and positive-moment prestress, 10% of the 127,500 kN pier cantilever prestress is 12,750 kN."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若預留能力取正負彎矩區預力的 10%：墩頂懸臂預力 127,500 kN 的 10% 為 12,750 kN，以每束 3,200 kN 計需 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 束，即在墩頂兩側各預留 2 組錨碇與孔道。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If the provision is 10% of the negative- and positive-moment prestress, 10% of the 127,500 kN pier cantilever prestress is 12,750 kN; at 3,200 kN per tendon that is 12,750/3,200 ≈ 4 tendons, i.e. two spare anchorages and ducts on each side of the pier. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b038-v13-39","title":"預力檢查、補強預留與交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「備用預力孔道」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Spare post-tensioning ducts” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"交接前做一次完整基準檢查：箱內裂縫圖與寬度、錨頭保護蓋狀態、灌漿孔與排氣孔封閉、跨中與墩頂高程、伸縮縫間隙，所有結果附照片與座標存入養護資料庫；之後每次定期檢查都與此基準比較，裂縫寬度或撓度增量超過門檻即啟動詳細評估。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before handover, carry out a full baseline inspection: crack maps and widths inside the box, anchor cap condition, sealing of grout and vent ports, midspan and pier levels, and joint gaps, with photographs and coordinates stored in the maintenance database; compare every later routine inspection with this baseline and trigger a detailed assessment if crack widths or deflection increments exceed thresholds. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件應包括施工階段分析、鋼腱張拉與灌漿紀錄、線形控制歷程、備用孔道位置圖、箱內檢查路線與安全進入程序；管理單位應排定首次詳細檢查並保存原始量測資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover documents should include the construction-stage analysis, stressing and grouting records, the geometry-control history, the spare-duct location plan, inspection routes inside the box and confined-space entry procedures; the owner should schedule the first detailed inspection and keep the raw survey data.","failure":"注意干擾：箱梁排水孔堵塞讓雨水積存在底板，沿錨碇與孔道滲入，鋼絞線多年後腐蝕斷裂，等到外觀出現縱向裂縫時損傷已大；若未預留補強錨碇，日後補強只能在既有箱梁上鑽孔植筋，風險與成本都高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Blocked box drains let rainwater pond on the bottom slab and seep along anchorages and ducts, corroding strands until they break years later, by which time visible longitudinal cracks show heavy damage; without spare anchorages, later strengthening needs drilling and doweling into the existing box, with high risk and cost. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"交接前做一次完整基準檢查：箱內裂縫圖與寬度、錨頭保護蓋狀態、灌漿孔與排氣孔封閉、跨中與墩頂高程、伸縮縫間隙，所有結果附照片與座標存入養護資料庫；之後每次定期檢查都與此基準比較，裂縫寬度或撓度增量超過門檻即啟動詳細評估。","textEn":"Before handover, carry out a full baseline inspection: crack maps and widths inside the box, anchor cap condition, sealing of grout and vent ports, midspan and pier levels, and joint gaps, with photographs and coordinates stored in the maintenance database; compare every later routine inspection with this baseline and trigger a detailed assessment if crack widths or deflection increments exceed thresholds.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件應包括施工階段分析、鋼腱張拉與灌漿紀錄、線形控制歷程、備用孔道位置圖、箱內檢查路線與安全進入程序；管理單位應排定首次詳細檢查並保存原始量測資料。","textEn":"Handover documents should include the construction-stage analysis, stressing and grouting records, the geometry-control history, the spare-duct location plan, inspection routes inside the box and confined-space entry procedures; the owner should schedule the first detailed inspection and keep the raw survey data.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「預力檢查、補強預留與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover\"?","options":["交接前做一次完整基準檢查：箱內裂縫圖與寬度、錨頭保護蓋狀態、灌漿孔與排氣孔封閉、跨中與墩頂高程、伸縮縫間隙，所有結果附照片與座標存入養護資料庫。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","線形誤差可以等到閉合時再一次修正。"],"optionsEn":["Before handover, carry out a full baseline inspection: crack maps and widths inside the box, anchor cap condition, sealing of grout and vent ports, midspan and pier levels, and joint gaps, with photographs and coordinates stored in the maintenance database.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Geometry errors can all be corrected at once at closure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"交接前做一次完整基準檢查：箱內裂縫圖與寬度、錨頭保護蓋狀態、灌漿孔與排氣孔封閉、跨中與墩頂高程、伸縮縫間隙，所有結果附照片與座標存入養護資料庫；之後每次定期檢查都與此基準比較，裂縫寬度或撓度增量超過門檻即啟動詳細評估。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before handover, carry out a full baseline inspection: crack maps and widths inside the box, anchor cap condition, sealing of grout and vent ports, midspan and pier levels, and joint gaps, with photographs and coordinates stored in the maintenance database; compare every later routine inspection with this baseline and trigger a detailed assessment if crack widths or deflection increments exceed thresholds. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b038-v13-40","title":"預力檢查、補強預留與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b038-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「備用預力孔道」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Spare post-tensioning ducts” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"箱梁排水孔堵塞讓雨水積存在底板，沿錨碇與孔道滲入，鋼絞線多年後腐蝕斷裂，等到外觀出現縱向裂縫時損傷已大；若未預留補強錨碇，日後補強只能在既有箱梁上鑽孔植筋，風險與成本都高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Blocked box drains let rainwater pond on the bottom slab and seep along anchorages and ducts, corroding strands until they break years later, by which time visible longitudinal cracks show heavy damage; without spare anchorages, later strengthening needs drilling and doweling into the existing box, with high risk and cost. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：現代規範要求預留備用孔道、錨碇與轉向塊，讓日後可以加裝體外鋼腱補償預力損失或增加載重能力；箱梁內部也需有照明、通風、排水與通行門，使檢查人員能沿全長走動。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Modern provisions call for spare ducts, anchorages and deviators so that external tendons can later be added to make up for losses or increase capacity, and the box interior needs lighting, ventilation, drainage and access doors so inspectors can walk its full length.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「預力混凝土箱梁內部沒有車輛荷載，所以不需要定期進入檢查。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The inside of a prestressed box girder carries no traffic, so it needs no routine inspection.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b038-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"箱梁排水孔堵塞讓雨水積存在底板，沿錨碇與孔道滲入，鋼絞線多年後腐蝕斷裂，等到外觀出現縱向裂縫時損傷已大；若未預留補強錨碇，日後補強只能在既有箱梁上鑽孔植筋，風險與成本都高。","textEn":"Blocked box drains let rainwater pond on the bottom slab and seep along anchorages and ducts, corroding strands until they break years later, by which time visible longitudinal cracks show heavy damage; without spare anchorages, later strengthening needs drilling and doweling into the existing box, with high risk and cost.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]},{"id":"b038-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「預力檢查、補強預留與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Tendon inspection, future-prestress provisions and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","箱梁排水孔堵塞讓雨水積存在底板，沿錨碇與孔道滲入，鋼絞線多年後腐蝕斷裂，等到外觀出現縱向裂縫時損傷已大。","平衡懸臂橋完工後的內力與施工期間一樣，只需用完工模型設計。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Blocked box drains let rainwater pond on the bottom slab and seep along anchorages and ducts, corroding strands until they break years later, by which time visible longitudinal cracks show heavy damage.","A balanced-cantilever bridge carries the same internal forces during construction as when finished, so the finished model is enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"箱梁排水孔堵塞讓雨水積存在底板，沿錨碇與孔道滲入，鋼絞線多年後腐蝕斷裂，等到外觀出現縱向裂縫時損傷已大；若未預留補強錨碇，日後補強只能在既有箱梁上鑽孔植筋，風險與成本都高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Blocked box drains let rainwater pond on the bottom slab and seep along anchorages and ducts, corroding strands until they break years later, by which time visible longitudinal cracks show heavy damage; without spare anchorages, later strengthening needs drilling and doweling into the existing box, with high risk and cost. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-pci-muller-ten-years-segmental","v13s-wje-koror-babeldaob","v13s-structurae-bendorf"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
